[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The measure of an exterior angle of a regular polygon is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \text{Measure of exterior angle} = \frac{360^\circ}{n}
