[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - 2 for 2, 5, 8, 11
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - 3 for 3, 6, 9, 12
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So 19 from first number is nothing but 1 + 9 ; 19 is 4 units behind 10 (101, 191).
