[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If the tenths place number is 4 or greater, you round up the hundreds place number by one. For example, if the tenths place number is 9, you would round it up to 10.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If the tenths place number is less than 4, you do not round up the hundreds place number. If the tenths place number is 3, you would round it down to the nearest whole number and write 89 in the hundreds place. If the tenths place number is 2, you would round it down to the nearest whole number and write 90 in the hundreds place.
