[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m      \text{Difference} = 215 \text{ inches} - 260 \text{ inches} = -45 \text{ inches}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m      \]
