[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Compute
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\begin{vmatrix} -5 & 3 \\ 4 & -4 \end{vmatrix}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Again, we need to compute the determinant of the matrix \[\begin{vmatrix} -5 & 3 \\ 4 & -4 \end{vmatrix}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We will use the formula for the determinant of a 2x2 matrix:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \text{det}\begin{pmatrix}a & b \\ c & d\end{pmatrix} = ad - bc.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m For our specific matrix:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m a = -5, \quad b = 3, \quad c = 4, \quad d = -4.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Substitute these values into the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \text{det} = (-5) \cdot (-4) - (3) \cdot 4.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Calculate each term:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m (-5) \cdot (-4) = 20,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m (3) \cdot 4 = 12.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, subtract the second term from the first:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 20 - 12 = 8.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, the determinant of the matrix is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \boxed{8}.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 8
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m [Is Boxed Matched]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m True
