[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Find the units digit of the sum, $$ 1! + 2! + 3! + \cdots + 2006!. $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We have to find the units digit that $$S = 2006! + 2005! + 2004!...+6!+5!+4! + 3!+2! +1! $$. For this, we use $$ 1! + 2! + 3! + \cdots + 2006! = (2-1)!, (2006+1)! = (2102-1)! = ((2101)+(1))! $$. Thus, $$S=(-1)^{2006+1}! $$ and $$ S = (2101!)/ 1 $$ $$= 2100! $$.<|endoftext|>
