[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. Calculate the total number of shots she takes in a week.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. Multiply the number of shots per day by the total number of days in a week to get the total shots: \(30 \text{ shots/day} \times 7 \text{ days} = 210 \text{ shots}\).
