[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If we sum up all the possibilities we recorded:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - With four distinct digits: $6^4 = 1296$ possibilities.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - With three distinct digits: $6 \times 6^3 = 288$ possibilities.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - With two distinct digits: $6 \times 6 \times 6^2 = 720$ possibilities in total for two out of four, and $3 \times 6 \times 6 \times 6^1 = 300$ possibilities in total for two out of three.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - With one distinct digit: $6 \times 6 \times 6 \times 4 \times 4 = 4608$ possibilities in total for one out of four, and $5 \times 6 \times 6 \times 6^1 = 6480$ possibilities in total for one out of three.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the sum of the possible sequences is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 1296 + 288 + 720 + 4608 + 6480 = 15018. \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So, the number of possible sequences is \(\boxed{15018}\).
