[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$ \binom{182}{180} = \frac{{182!}}{{180! \cdot 2!}} = \frac{182 \cdot 181 \cdot 180!}{180 \cdot 180! \cdot 2 \cdot 1} $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We notice that 180! in both the numerator and denominator should cancel out:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$ \binom{182}{180} = \frac{182 \cdot 181}{2} = \boxed{182 \cdot 181} $$.
