[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. Each of \(A\), \(B\), and \(C\) has no common prime factors.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. Each of \(A\), \(B\), and \(C\) has no perfect-square factors other than 1.
