[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We are asked to find the length of arc $RP$. As $O$ is the center of the circle, the angle $\angle RIP$ is inscribed in the arc $RP$. 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First, we find the measure of $\angle RIP$. Since $\angle RIP$ is created by the intersection of radii $\_{OP}$ and $\_{OR}$, we can recognize that $\angle RIP$ is inscribed in arc $RP$. Let $\angle RIP = \theta = 36^\circ$. 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, we know that a central angle subtended by an arc is twice the measure of the arc itself. In arc $RP$, the angle $\angle RIP$ makes up, this arc:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \text{{arc}}(RP) = 2\angle RIP = 2(36^\circ) = 72^\circ.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The full circle is $360^\circ$, so a quarter circle (which is $\frac{1}{4}$ of a circle) would subtend an angle of:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \text{{arc}}(1 \text{ quarter worded cycle}) = \frac{\text{{arc}}(RP)}{4} = \frac{72^\circ}{4} = 18^\circ.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, we need to find the length of the arc $RP$ given that the radius $OR = 10$ cm. The length of an arc (arc length) is given by $r \cdot (2\pi/n)$, where $r$ is the radius, $2\pi/n$ is the central angle ($2\pi/r$ radians), and $n$ is the number of equal divisions around the circle.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m In this case, $n = 1$, the central angle subtended by the arc is $18^\circ$, and the radius $r = 10$ cm:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \text{{arc length}} = 10 \cdot (2\pi/18) = 10 \cdot \frac{2\pi}{18} = \frac{10 \cdot 2\pi}{18} = \frac{20\pi}{18} = \frac{10\pi}{9}.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
