[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ x = a + b + c + d \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ y = a - c + d - e + e \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ z = b + c + d - e - e \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ w = c + e + d + d e \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We can simplify the equations by adding and subtracting them. First, add \(x\) and \(y\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ x + y = (a + b + c + d) + (a - c + d - e + e) = 2a + 2d + c + b - e + d = 2a + b + c + e + d \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, subtract \(z\) from \(y\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ y - z = (a - c + d - e + e) - (b + c + d - e - e) = a - c + d - e + e - b - c - d + c = a - b + d - c \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Then, add \(z\) to \(x\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ x + z = (a + b + c + d) + (b + c + d - e - e) = a + b + c + d + b + c - e - e = a + 2b + 2c - 2e \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Finally, subtract \(w\) from \(z\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ z - w = (b + c + d - e - e) - (c + e + d + d e) = b + c + d - e - e - c - e - d e = b - 2c - 2d - d e \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, add the four simplified expressions together:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ x + y + z + w = (2a + b + c + e + d) + (2a + b + d - c) + (a + 2b + 2c - 2e) + (b - 2c - 2d - d e) \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ = 2a + 2a + 2b + 2c - 2e + a + b + 2b + 2c - 2e + b - 2c - 2d - d e \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ = 5a + 6b + 5e - 2d e \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ = 5(a + b + e - d e) \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To maximize \(x + y + z + w\), we need to minimize \(5(a + b + e - d e)\). The minimum value of \((a + b + e - d e)\) occurs when \(a = b = e\). If \(a = b = e\), then:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ x + y + z + w = 5(a + a + a - d a) = 5(3a - d a) = 5(3 - d) \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To minimize \(3 - d\), we choose \(d = 0\) (since \(d\) is a positive integer and we want the minimum value of 3 - d, \(d = 0\) is the only possible value for such a case). Then:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
