[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m -4(2x+8) = 4(2x+5)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Simplify both sides by distributing the constants:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
