[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m -52 = 16x
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Solve for \(x\) by dividing both sides by 16:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m x = \frac{-52}{16}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Simplify the fraction:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
