[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    4^{2x+4} = 4^{2x+4}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    - This is always true, meaning it is an identity.
