[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### State Machine Logic
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If you need to create a particular sequence of states next to each other, you can build a state machine that transitions between these states.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
