[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The formula for choosing 15 items out of 16 is $\dbinom{16}{15}$. This is the coefficient of $x^{15}$ in the expansion of $(x+1)^{16}$. Since $16=4+1$, the coefficient of $x^{16} - 10x^{14} + 20x^{12} - 10x^8 + 1$ is $10$, which is the absolute minimum value between the two. Therefore, we can conclude that $\dbinom{16}{15} = 10$.
