[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Step 1: Raise $(-5)^5$ to the power of 5. 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$(-5)^5 = (-5)*( -5)*( -5)*( -5)*( -5) = -3125$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Step 2: Raise $5^3$ to the power of 3. 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$5^3 = (5)*(5)*(5) = 125$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Step 3: Raise $3^4$ to the power of 2. 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$3^4 = (3)*(3)*(3)*(3) = 81$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Step 4: Raise $6^1$ to the power of 2. 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$6^1 = (6)*(6) = 36$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Step 5: Rewrite $(-5)^5\div5^3+3^{4}-6^{1}$ as
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$(-3125)\div125+81-36$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Step 6: Divide $-3125\div125$ by 5. 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$(-3125)\div125= -24$$
