[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Find all values of $a$ so that the lines specified by
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 2 \\ a \end{pmatrix} + t \begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ 3 \\ 4 \end{pmatrix}\]and
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\begin{pmatrix} 4 \\ 1 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix} + u \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ 2 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}\]are skew.
