[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now we can calculate $\arcsin\left(\frac{20}{5\pi}\right)$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{aligned} \arcsin\left(\frac{20}{5\pi}\right)&= \arcsin\left(0.1164\right)\\ &=0.1191\\ &=0.12\end{aligned}So, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{aligned} &(-20r)\left(\frac{5\pi}{2} - 20 + 24\right)\\ &=-20r\cdot 2\pi + 20^2\\ &=-40r\pi+200\end{aligned}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
