[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m x(x+1) < 400
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We can approximate \( x \) by solving:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
