[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve this, we will propagate coefficients step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m When $x = 0$,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m -2(0^7 - 0^4 + 3 \cdot 0^2 - 5) + 4(0^3 + 3) - 3(0^2 - 4) &= 2 - 12 - (-4) \\
