[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m      - 3 socks stay in place.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m      - \( S \) + 3 remain.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. **Calculate the number of shirts that stay in place on the shelves after every 8th display:**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    - After every 8
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 10
