[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m which simplifies to,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$f(0) = f(0)^2.$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, let's take a closer look at the original condition and see what happens when we substitute $y = kx$ ($k$ is just an integer, an arbitrary non-zero integer). We get,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
