[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m -step 3 To find the projection of a vector $\mathbf{v}$ onto another vector $\mathbf{w},$ we use the scalar projection formula given by $$v w=\frac{\left ||w||^2 v\right ||}{||v||}.$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m -step 4 In our case: We have $\mathbf{v} = \begin{pmatrix} 4 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix},$ and $\mathbf{w} = \begin{pmatrix} 0 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix},$
