[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\frac{1}{2} (x + y) w = \frac{1}{2} (36w)$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m where $w = 1 / 36$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The geometric mean of $x$ and $y$ is given by the square root of $xy = 6$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\sqrt{xy} = \sqrt{6}$$
