[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m         *   Multiply any two identical numbers (-5) to get a consecutive power of 5.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m     2. + (-2)^3
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m         *   Multiply a number (-2) to get 2.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m     3. + 2^3
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m         *   Multiply a number 2 to get 8.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m     4. + 5^3
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m         *   Multiply a number 5 to get 125.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
