[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve the equation \( 81^{2x} = 27^{3x - 4} \), we start by expressing both sides with the same base. 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. **Express \( 81 \) and \( 27 \) as powers of 3:**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    - \( 81 = 3^4 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    - \( 27 = 3^3 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. **Rewrite the base equation using the prime factorization:**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    81^{2x} = (3^4)^{2x} = 3^{4(2x)}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    27^{3x - 4} = (3^3)^{3x - 4} = 3^{3(3x - 4)}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. **Simplify the exponents:**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    - For \( 81^{2x} \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m      \left( 3^5 \right)^{2x} = 3^{10x}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    - For \( 27^{3x - 4} \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m      \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m      \left( 3^3 \right)^{3x - 4} = 3^{3(3x - 4)} = 3^{9x - 12}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. **Set the exponents equal to each other:**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    3^{10x} = 3^{9x - 12}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 5. **Since the bases are the same, the exponents must be equal:**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    10x = 9x - 12
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 6. **Solve for \( x \):**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    10x - 9x = -12
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    x = -12
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, the solution to the equation \( 81^{2x} = 27^{3x - 4} \) is \( x = -12 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \boxed{-12}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
