[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We are interested in the greatest common divisor (GCD) of 570 with 256. In other words, find the GCD of (n)(n+1)(n+2)(n+3) and 256.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let's break down the reasoning:
