[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. **Inductive Step (if existence):**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    - Inductively observe that \(n - 256\) must divide by at least one consecutive integer because ( n ), ( n+1 ), ( n+2 ), ( n+3 ) share factors leading to at least max(n-256, 1) divisibility.
