[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 5. Divide both sides by $29$ to solve for $x$:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m x = \frac{-10}{29}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
