[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now subtract the total number of problems from the total no. of questions to find how many questions a student must miss:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 35 - x \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Substituting \(x\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 35 - \left(\frac{1}{35}\right) \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now we'll get the answer.
