[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m In the diagram, $R$ is on $QS$ and $QR=8$. Also, $PR=12$, $\angle PRQ=120^\circ$, and $\angle RPS = 90^\circ$. What is the area of $\triangle QPS$? [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m //C19
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m size(10cm); // ADJUST
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m import olympiad;
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m // Point coordinates
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m pair r = (0, 0);
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m pair q = (-8, 0);
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m pair p = 12 * dir(60);
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m pair s = (24, 0);
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
