[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve this equation, we need to square both sides of the equation to eliminate the square root:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \left(\frac{30}{50}\right)^2 &= \left(\sqrt{\frac{y}{50}}\right)^2\\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \frac{900}{2500} &= \frac{y}{50}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, we simplify by dividing both sides by 50:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \frac{900}{2500} &= \frac{y}{50}\\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \frac{9}{25} &= \frac{y}{50}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, we cross-multiply to solve for $y$:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 9 \cdot 50 &= 25 \cdot y\\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 450 &= 25y\\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \frac{450}{25} &= y\\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 18 &= y
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{align*}
