[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So, the value of $y$ in the equation is $\boxed{18}$.eworthypromptmentarefoundjoy | To find the value of \( y \) in the equation \(\frac{30}{50} = \sqrt{\frac{y}{50}}\), we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. Simplify the left side of the equation.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \frac{30}{50} = \frac{30 \div 10}{50 \div 10} = \frac{3}{5}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. Equate the simplified left side to the right side of the equation.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \frac{3}{5} = \sqrt{\frac{y}{50}}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. Square both sides of the equation to eliminate the square root.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \left(\frac{3}{5}\right)^2 = \left(\sqrt{\frac{y}{50}}\right)^2
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \frac{9}{25} = \frac{y}{50}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. To solve for \( y \), cross-multiply.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    9 \cdot 50 = 25 \cdot y \cdot 1
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    900 = 25y
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 5. Divide both sides by 25.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    y = \frac{900}{25}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    y = 36
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So, the value of \( y \) is \(\boxed{36}\).<|endoftext|>
