[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve this problem, we'll follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. Determine the reading rates of both Xanthia and Molly.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. Calculate the total number of pages completely read by each.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. Find the difference in the number of pages read by both.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. Convert the unknown time (in minutes) to hours to calculate the difference in reading time.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
