[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. Since 7.19 is not a prime number, q must be a prime number within the range of whole numbers between 1 and 7.190625. Therefore, the only candidate is q=7.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 5. Now we need to find the edges length of the rectangular solid. Since it is a rectangular solid, the edges are related by width (w), length (l), and height (h). That means w: l: h=1: \sqrt{7}: \sqrt{7}.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 6. Solving for l and h, we have l: \sqrt{7}: \sqrt{7}={1 \over 2}): {1 \over 2}: \sqrt{7}.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 7. L can be computed by rationalizing the terms: w h={1: \sqrt{7}: \sqrt{7}):(1 \over 2): {1 \over 2}: \sqrt{7}=1 \over 7: 7.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m This way the dimensions can be calculated.
