[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### Condition (4): \(ax^2 + by^2 = 6\)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Again, \(a = \frac{1}{b}\), so:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
