[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Since \((x - 1)^2 = x^3 - 2x^2 + x - 1\), we can compare the coefficients of the two expressions:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m x^3 + bx + c = x^3 - 2x^2 + x - 1
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m By comparing the coefficients, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
