[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the ordered pair \((b, c)\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \boxed{(-2, -1)}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
