[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The consecutive angles of a particular trapezoid form an arithmetic sequence.  If the largest angle measures $120^{\circ}$, what is the measure of the smallest angle?
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
