[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To compute $\tan315$, we need to first identify which quadrant 315 lies in.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Since this value is negative and greater than $\frac{\pi}{2}$ and $\pi$, it is in the third quadrant.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m In this quadrant, the tangent is the same as the cosine.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So, we have $\tan315 = - \tan 135$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Since the tangent is negative in the third quadrant, we have $\tan 315 = - \tan135 = - \frac{-1}{- \sqrt2}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, $\tan315 = \boxed{1}$.
