[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \\*\\*Convert $\\frac{73}{100}$ to a percent\\\\*\\*
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To convert a fraction to a percent, we multiply the fraction by 100:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\frac{73}{100} \times 100\ = \ 73 \times 1\ % \ = \ 73\ %$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
