[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First, let us ignore all the negatives in the denominator, we have,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\frac{a+3}{\left(\sqrt{a^2-4}\right)^2-(\sqrt{a^2 -4})\times 0=}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Upon simplifying, we get,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\frac{a+3}{a^2-4}\to \frac{a+3}{\left(\sqrt{a^2-4}+\sqrt{a^2-4}\right)\times \left(\sqrt{a^2-4}-\sqrt{a^2-4}\right)}=\frac{a+3}{4}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m For the above fraction to be undefined, either numerator or denominator should be 0,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1) From numerator, iff $a+3=0$, we get $a=-3$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2) From denominator, iff $\sqrt{a^2-4}=\pm \sqrt{a^2-4}$, $\pm \sqrt{a^2-4}=a\pm 2$, hence,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\pm \sqrt{a^2-4}=a+2\ or\ \pm \sqrt{a^2-4}=a-2,$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We get $a=0$ or $\boxed{a=2}$. Therefore,$a\in\{-3\,,0\,,2\}$.
