[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Three vertices of a cube are $P=(7,12,10)$, $Q=(8,8,1)$, and $R=(11,3,9)$. What is the side length of the cube?
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find the side length of the cube, we'll first need to calculate the distances between each pair of vertices.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $PQ$: 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We just need to subtract $QR$ from $PQ$:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \|.{PQ}\| &= \|{\left[{7,12,10}\right] - \left[{8,8,1}\right]} \| \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \sqrt{{\|{7-8}\|^2 + {12-8}\|^2 + {10-1}\|^2} \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \sqrt{{(-1)\^2 + 4^2 + 9^2} \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \sqrt{{1 + 16 + 81} \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \sqrt{98} \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= 7\sqrt{2}.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $PR$: 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Again, we simply need to subtract $QR$ from $PR$:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \|.{PR}\| &= \|{\left[{7,12,10}\right] - \left[{11,3,9}\right]} \| \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \sqrt{{\|{7-11}\|^2 + {12-3}\|^2 + {10-9}\|^2} \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \sqrt{{(-4)\^2 + 9^2 + 1^2} \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \sqrt{{16 + 81 + 1} \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \sqrt{98} \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= 7\sqrt{2}.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $RP$: 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find $RP$, we need to add the two distances and then take its square root:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \|.{RP}\| &= \|{\left[{7,12,10}\right] - \left[{11,3,9}\right]} \|^2 + \left|{7\sqrt{2}} + \left[ {?} \right] \right|\\\\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \left[ {\left[{7-11}\right]^2 + {12-3}\]^2 + {10-9}\^2} + \sqrt{25 + 90 + 9} \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \left[ {(-4)^2 + 9^2 + 1^2} \right] + \sqrt{89 + 99} \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= 49 + \sqrt{188}.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, the side length of the cube is $\boxed{7\sqrt{2}}$.
