[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m (-26w + 13)^2 = 141 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let's simplify the equation initially and check our results step by step.
