[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m For a matrix $\mathbf{M},$ the trace of $\mathbf{M}$ is defined as the sum of its diagonal elements.  For example,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\operatorname{Tr} \begin{pmatrix} a & b \\ c & d \end{pmatrix} = a + d.\]Given $\operatorname{Tr} (\mathbf{A}) = 2$ and $\operatorname{Tr} (\mathbf{A}^2) = 30,$ find $\det \mathbf{A}.$
