[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 解 ：由于 $\sqrt{92}$ 与 $18$ 无等量关, 所取作$8$。由题意知, ${x}^{2},{y}^{2}$ 曝发是互惠逆置方形。
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\frac{8^2} {\sqrt{\frac{8}{18}}} = \frac{64\sqrt{18}}2 \sqrt{8^2}= \frac{64}{ \sqrt{18}} = \frac{64}{\sqrt{18}\sqrt{18}} = \frac{64}{\sqrt{324}}=\frac{64 \sqrt{14} \sqrt{14}}{324}=\frac{64\sqrt{14}}{36}= \frac{16}{9}\sqrt{14}= \boxed{400}$$
