[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \pi^3 \tan\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right) = -\frac{\pi^5}{3!} \left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)^3 \left(\frac{1}{7}\right)^2 + \frac{\pi^7}{5!} \left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)^5 \left(\frac{1}{7}\right)^3 - \frac{\pi^9}{7!} \left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)^7 \left(\frac{1}{7}\right)^4 + \cdots
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If we let $a = \tan\left(\frac{\pi}{7}\right)$, we can approximate the series like this:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
