[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So we can express $\mathbf{A}^{2018}$ as:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \mathbf{A}^{2018} = \left( \frac{2}{3} \right)^{2018} \mathbf{I}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
