[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 8. Python Code:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ```python
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m import math
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m log_2 = math.log(2)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m log_6 = math.log(6)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m # Calculate log_6(256)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m log_6_256 = 6 * log_2
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m print(log_6_256)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ```
