[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First, we'll address the absolute value in the complex number expression, \(\frac{(-64i)(7+4i)}{2-6i}\). To simplify the numerator, we start by multiplying out the product of the complex numbers:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
