[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - \(9 \times 9 = 81\), units digit = 1
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Finally, let's add the units digits of these products: \(1 + 4 + 9 + 6 + 5 + 6 + 9 + 4 + 1 = 46\).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The units digit of 46 is \(6\).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the units digit in the product of all natural numbers from 1 to 99 is \(\boxed{6}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
