[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find the value of $\sqrt{3\cdot6\cdot10\cdot15\cdot21\cdot28}$, we first need to multiply the numbers inside the square root together:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\sqrt{(3)(6)(10)(15)(21)(28)}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, let's find a way to simplify this multiplication to reduce the number of terms we have to multiply:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\sqrt{(3)(3)(6)(3)(3)(15)}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\because$ $(3\cdot3)=9$ then$(9\cdot6)=54$ then$(54\cdot3)=162$ then$(162\cdot15)=2430$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, $\sqrt{2430}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, multiply the results:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\sqrt{2430}=30\sqrt{3}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\because$ $\sqrt3=1.73205$ so
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\sqrt{3}\cdot\sqrt{3}\cdot\sqrt{3}\cdot\sqrt{3}=3\cdot2\cdot3\cdot 1.73205 = 22.3333$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, $\sqrt{2430}=30\sqrt{3}$, and finally
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\boxed{\sqrt{2430}=30\times\sqrt{3}}$<|endoftext|>
