[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Given that $A = (\sqrt{2008}+\sqrt{2009}),$ $B = (-\sqrt{2008}-\sqrt{2009}),$ $C = (\sqrt{2008}-\sqrt{2009}),$ and $D = (\sqrt{2009}-\sqrt{2008}),$ find $ABCD.$
