[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First, we express the complex number in the standard form of complex number: $5-12i$. Then, we find the modulus of the complex number.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\left[\begin{array}{c}5 \\ -12\end{array}\right]=\sqrt{{(5)}^{2}+{(12)}^{2}}=\sqrt{25+144}=25\sqrt{2}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the magnitude of the complex number $5-12i$ is $25\sqrt{2}$.
