[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If we translate the postfix notation $(-5)^3 + (-2)^3 + 2^3 + 5^3$ into an infix notation, it would be ($5^3$ , $3[-2^3] +2^3\vDash 5^3$). Therefore, the correct answer is ([5^3, 3[-2^3])+2^3 + 5^3)..fillText({};9)
