[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    - The value changes from 0 to 1 at each iteration; thus, the positive root must exist as an odd (i.e., real) root.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    - By constructing \( q(x) \) iteratively:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m      \[ q(x) = x^n + x^{n-1} + \dots + x + 1 = 0 \]
