[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We confirm the decimal division but then note the reminder is zero since \((-1623) + 34 \cdot 8 = -8 \) which is more than \( 8 \) upwards but multiple of multiples adjust to give a remainder of \( 0\). 
