[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Step 2: Calculate the number of ways to select one male lead.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m There are four males, so selecting one male would be 4 ways.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Step 3: Calculate the number of ways to select three objects (animals) that can be played by either gender.
