[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The region between the graph of $y = f (x)$ and the $x$-axis, shaded in this figure, has an area of 10 square units. What will be the area between the graph of $y = 3f (x -2)$ and the $x$-axis?
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m defaultpen(linewidth(0.75));
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m fill((10,0)..(30,20)..(40,15)--(50,40)..(58,39)--(70,0)--cycle,gray(.7));
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m draw((10,0)..(30,20)..(40,15)--(50,40)..(58,39)--(70,0)--cycle);
