[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Consider the geometric sequence $\frac{16}{9}, \frac{8}{3}, 4, 6, 9, \ldots$. What is the eighth term of the sequence? Express your answer as a common fraction.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
