[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Same goes for $0.\overline{27}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Hence, $\frac{72}{1000} = 0.72$ and $\frac{27}{1000}$ = 0.27. Combining these gives $\frac{72}{1000}$ and $\frac{27}{1000}$. Now subtract
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 0.\overline{72} - \frac{27}{1000} &= 0.72 - 0.27 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= 0
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m and $\frac{27}{1000}$ = 0.27. Hence, $\frac{0}{0.27} = 0$.
