[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Find all solutions to the equation \[\frac{\left(\frac{x}{x+1}\right)^2 + 11}{\left(\frac{x}{x+1}\right)^2 + 1} = 2.\]Enter all the solutions, separated by commas.
