[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find the value of $n$, it's crucial to recognize that $n$ is an odd number because it must satisfy the condition $n \equiv 5 \pmod{8}$. This implies $n$ is an odd number since it leaves a remainder of 5 when divided by 8.
