[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Example: 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First Value -> $C ( 12 5) = 0.4$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Second Value -> $C ( 13 6) = 0.5$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Total is $\frac{1}{C ( 5 4)} + \frac{1}{C ( 6 5)} + \frac{0.4}{0.5}$
