[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \sqrt[4]{5^4+1} = \sqrt[4]{5^4+1}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \sqrt[4]{5^4-1} = \sqrt[4]{5^4-1}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To simplify \(\sqrt[4]{5^4+1}\) and \(\sqrt[4]{5^4-1}\) further, note that:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \sqrt[4]{5^4} = 5
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \sqrt[4]{5^4+1} = \sqrt[4]{5 \cdot 5} = \sqrt[4]{25}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \sqrt[4]{5^4-1} = \sqrt[4]{5 \cdot 5+1} = \sqrt[4]{26}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \sqrt[4]{5^4+1} - \sqrt[4]{5^4-1} = \sqrt[4]{25} - \sqrt[4]{26}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Step 2: Simplify the numerator:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let \( x = \min(625, 25) \) and \( y = \min(5, 26) \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Then, \( x \leq \sqrt[4]{x} \)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Additionally,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 5 < 26
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Step 3: Calculate the values:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 625 = x^4
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \sqrt[4]{x} = 625^{1/4}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Not all fourth roots are pure fourth roots, especially when \( x = 5 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 625^{1/4} = \sqrt[4]{625} = 5
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m x + 25 = 30
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Since \( 30 < 5 \neq 25 \),
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m we have
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \sqrt[4]{30} \approx 2.61
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, \( \sqrt[4]{25} \approx 2.57 \) and \( \sqrt[4]{26} approximately 3.96 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Step 4: Combine the results:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
