[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Within the tenths, hundredths, and thousandths places but immediately before the hundredths place, we want to identify whether to keep the number as it is or to round it down (i.e., lose a ten). The digit just to the right of the hundredths place and earlier is the nearest hundredth.
