[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Find the minimum value of
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\frac{\left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^6 - \left( x^6 + \dfrac{1}{x^6} \right) - 2}{\left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 + \left( x^3 + \dfrac{1}{x^3} \right)}\]for $x > 0.$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve the problem, we start with the given expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \frac{\left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^6 - \left( x^6 + \dfrac{1}{x^6} \right) - 2}{\left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 + \left( x^3 + \dfrac{1}{x^3} \right)}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let's denote \(\sinh(x) = \left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^2\). We can express the numerator and the denominator in terms of the sinh function as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Numerator:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^6 = (\sinh(x))^2 = \left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^4
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \left( x^6 + \dfrac{1}{x^6} \right) = (\sinh(x))^2 - 1 = \left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^4 - 1
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^6 - \left( x^6 + \dfrac{1}{x^6} \right) - 2 = \left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^4 - 1 - 2 = \left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^4 - 3 = \sinh^4(x) - 3 = (\sinh(x))^4 - 3
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 + \left( x^3 + \dfrac{1}{x^3} \right) = (\sinh(x))^2 + 1 = \left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^2 + 1 = 2\sinh^2(x) + 1
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \left( x^3 + \dfrac{1}{x^3} \right) = (\sinh(x))^2 - 1 + \left( \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 + \left( \dfrac{1}{x^3} \right) = (\sinh(x))^2 - 1 + \left( \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 + \left( \dfrac{1}{x^3} \right)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \left( x^3 + \dfrac{1}{x^3} \right) = \left( \sinh(x)^2 - 1 \right) - \left( \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 - \left( \dfrac{1}{x^3} \right) + 3\left( \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 + \left( \dfrac{1}{x^3} \right) = \left( \sinh^2(x) - 3 + \left( \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 \right) = \left( \sinh^2(x) - 3 \right) + \left( \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, substitute these into the original expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \sinh^4(x) - 3 = \left( \sinh^2(x) - 3 \right) + \left( \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 - 3 = \left( \sinh^2(x) - 6 \right) + \left( \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2\sinh^2(x) + 1 = -6 + \left( \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 + 3\left( \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 + \left( \dfrac{1}{x^3} \right) = -6 + 4\left( \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 + \dfrac{1}{x^3}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \left( \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 + \left( \dfrac{1}{x^3} \right) = -\left( 2\left( \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^2 + 1 \right) + 3\left( \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 + \dfrac{1}{x^3} = -\left( 2\left( \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^2 + 1 \right) + \dfrac{1}{x^2} + \dfrac{1}{x^3} = -2 + \dfrac{1}{x^2} - 2 = -4 + \dfrac{1}{x^2} + \dfrac{1}{x^3}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Substituting back into the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \frac{\left( \sinh(x) \right)^4 - 3}{2\sinh^2(x) + 1 - 4 + \dfrac{1}{x^2} + \dfrac{1}{x^3}} = \frac{(\sinh(x))^4 - 3}{2\sinh^2(x) + 1 - 4 + \dfrac{1}{x^2} + \dfrac{1}{x^3}} = \frac{(\sinh(x))^4 - 2}{2\sinh^2(x) + \dfrac{1}{x^2} + \dfrac{1}{x^3} - \dfrac{1}{x^2}}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Since \(\sinh(x) = 2\sinh(1)\), we can substitute \(2\sinh(1)\) for \(\sinh(x)\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m (\sinh(x))^4 = (2\sinh(1))^4 = 16\sinh^4(1)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m (\sinh(x))^3 = 2\sinh(1) \sinh(1.111) = 2\sinh^2(1) \sinh(1.111)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m (\sinh(x))^4 - 2 = 16\sinh^4(1) - 2 = 16(\sinh^2(1))^2 - 2 \approx 15.37 \times 10^{-2}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
