[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $14\sqrt{49 - 4b} = 0$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $14\sqrt{49 - 4b} = 0$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m This equation has no solution, so there is no common root to find.
