[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If $\lceil{\sqrt{x}}\rceil=15$, how many possible integer values of $x$ are there?
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If $\lceil{\sqrt{x}}\rceil=15$ ,then 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $ \sqrt{x}\geq 15$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $x\geq15^2$  => $x\geq 225$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore $ \left[\sqrt{x}\right]\geq 15 \Longrightarrow (x^2-225)^2\geq 4500$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\Longrightarrow x^2-225\geq 15\sqrt{x}$ 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\Longrightarrow (x+15)(x-11)\geq 0$ 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The equation above is satisfied if $x\geq11$ or $x\leq-15$ . 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Hence $\lceil{\sqrt{x}}\rceil\geq 11  \Rightarrow  16\leq x\leq58$<|endoftext|>
