[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 作为很擅长解数学题的高中老师，在△ABC中,内角A,B,C所对的边分别为a,b,c,已知a=1,求$\frac{a}{cosC}$+$\frac{c}{cosA}$的最小值. 解:在△ABC中,∵内角A,B,C所对的边分别为a,b,c,∴(2acosC)^{2}+2AsinC-(sin^{2}C+sin^{2}A)S=(sinAcosC+cosAsinC)(sinAcosC+cosAsinC). ∴(2sinAcosC)^{2}-($\frac{{“}}{2}$sinAsinCcosC)(sin^{2}C+cosAsinC)=0. ∴2(sinAcos^{2}C)=sin^{2}A•cos^{2}C+cosAsin^{2}C•2sinC. ∴(2cosA)•2cosA=sin^{2}A•cos^{2}C+cosAsin^{2}C•2sinC. 1cos^{2}A•cos^{2}C*2sinC-2(cosA-sinA)cosA*sinc≠0. 则$\frac{a}{cosC}=\frac{c}{sinC}$+1, 根据余弦定理可得a^{2}=c^{2}+b^{2}-2bccosA. ∴$\frac{a}{cosC}=\frac{c}{sinC}+1=\frac{{c}^{2}+{b}^{2}-2bccosA}{csinC}+1$. ∵cosA=$\frac{{b}^{2}+{c}^{2}-{a}^{2}}{2bc}$, ∴$\frac{a}{cosC}=\frac{c}{sinC}+1=\frac{{c}^{2}+{b}^{2}-2bccosA}{2bccoS}$=B+$\sqrt{3}$A+1. 又A+B+C=π, ∴$\frac{a}{cosC}$=$\frac{c}{sinC}$+1=$\sqrt{3+B}$+1≥2$\sqrt{3}$+1, ∴到$\frac{a}{cosC}+\frac{c}{cosA}$的最小值是4.
