[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \log_{10} (k - 2)! + \log_{10} (k - 1)! = \log_{10} [(\kappa - 2)! (\cdots)*(k - 2)! \cdots (\kappa - 2)!]
