[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve this inequality, we will first factorize and then use the property of the discriminant to divide the inequality through by 4:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Working: $(z-7)(z-5) \le 7$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Setting the inequality equal to zero:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $(z-7)(z-5) \le 7$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If the coefficient of each term is 1, we can separate the inequality as the two cases: $(z-7)(-(z-5)) \le 7$(z)(8) < 7and $(z-7)(z-5) \le 7$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If the coefficient of $(z-7)$ is 1, the inequality is $(z-5)(z-7) \le 7$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m When we divide both sides of ($\textbf{I}$) by 4, the inequality becomes $(z-7/4)z \le \frac 7 4$. If $\textit{z} \le 7$, the inequality is true. And if $\textit{z} \ge 7$, the inequality is false.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Working:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If the coefficient of $(z-5)$ is 1, the inequality is $(z-5)(z-7) \le 7$. This is equivalent to (z-5)(z-7) =8.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Since the coefficient of (z-7) is greater than 1, the inequality is false whenever $\textit{z} \le 7$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If the coefficient of $(z-5)$ is not equal to 1, we can divide neither side of the expression by (z-5).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m UNLESS z-5 is not 0, the way this goes: (z-5)(z-7) < 8. If z-5 is 0, the inequality is impossible (it becomes z-5 = 0, which → z =5, we know is not true).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We have:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\textbf{Case I}: \; \;\; z-5 = 0 \, , \; \textit{and} \, z \ge 7$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m And also:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\textbf{Case II}: \; \; \; z-5 \ne 0 \, , \; \frac 1 {z-5} \, \ge \, \frac 4 8$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Working:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $(z-5)(z-7) < 8 \, \to z-5 <-8/7 \, \to -8/7 < z \, < (-5+8/7) \, \to 11/7 < z < 2$ Since z must be greater than or equal to 7, the answer is 11/7 < z < 2.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Final Answer: $(11/7, 2]$ $$
