[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If $x$, $y$, and $z$ are real numbers for which  \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m x+y-z &= -8, \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m x-y+z &= 18,\text{ and} \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m -x+y+z &= 30, \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{align*} then what is $xyz$?
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
