[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    Substituting into the slope-intercept form \( y = mx \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    36 = \frac{2}{9} \cdot (32 - c)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    Solving for \( c \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
