[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m There exists a scalar $c$ so that
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\mathbf{i} \times (\mathbf{v} \times \mathbf{i}) + \mathbf{j} \times (\mathbf{v} \times \mathbf{j}) + \mathbf{k} \times (\mathbf{v} \times \mathbf{k}) = c \mathbf{v}\]for all vectors $\mathbf{v}.$  Find $c.$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve for the scalar \( c \) that satisfies the given vector equation, we start by using vector identities and properties. Let \(\mathbf{v} = \begin{bmatrix} v_1 \\ v_2 \\ v_3 \end{bmatrix}\). The cross products are defined as:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \mathbf{v} \times \mathbf{i} = v_3 \mathbf{j} - v_2 \mathbf{k}, \quad \mathbf{v} \times \mathbf{j} = -v_3 \mathbf{k} + v_2 \mathbf{j}, \quad \mathbf{v} \times \mathbf{k} = -v_3 \mathbf{j} - v_2 \mathbf{k}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Given the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \mathbf{i} \times (\mathbf{v} \times \mathbf{i}) + \mathbf{j} \times (\mathbf{v} \times \mathbf{j}) + \mathbf{k} \times (\mathbf{v} \times \mathbf{k}) = c \mathbf{v}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Substitute the vector identities into the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{bmatrix} 1 \\ 0 \\ 0 \end{bmatrix} \times \begin{bmatrix} v_3 \\ -v_3 \\ v_2 \end{bmatrix} + \begin{bmatrix} 0 \\ 1 \\ 0 \end{bmatrix} \times \begin{bmatrix} -v_3 \\ v_2 \\ -v_2 \end{bmatrix} + \begin{bmatrix} 0 \\ 0 \\ 1 \end{bmatrix} \times \begin{bmatrix} -v_3 \\ -v_2 \\ -v_3 \end{bmatrix} = c \mathbf{v}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Calculate each term separately:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. The cross product \(\begin{bmatrix} 1 \\ 0 \\ 0 \end{bmatrix} \times \begin{bmatrix} v_3 \\ -v_3 \\ v_2 \end{bmatrix}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{vmatrix} \mathbf{i} & \mathbf{j} & \mathbf{k} \\ 1 & 0 & 0 \\ v_3 & -v_3 & v_2 \end{vmatrix} = (0 \cdot v_2 - 0 \cdot -v_3) \mathbf{i} - (1 \cdot v_2 - 0 \cdot v_3) \mathbf{j} + (1 \cdot -v_3 - 0 \cdot -v_3) \mathbf{k} = v_2 \mathbf{i} + v_2 \mathbf{j} - v_3 \mathbf{k}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. The cross product \(\begin{bmatrix} 0 \\ 1 \\ 0 \end{bmatrix} \times \begin{bmatrix} -v_3 \\ v_2 \\ -v_2 \end{bmatrix}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{vmatrix} \mathbf{i} & \mathbf{j} & \mathbf{k} \\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\ -v_3 & v_2 & -v_2 \end{vmatrix} = (1 \cdot -v_2 - 0 \cdot v_2) \mathbf{i} - (0 \cdot -v_2 - 0 \cdot -v_3) \mathbf{j} + (0 \cdot v_2 - 1 \cdot -v_3) \mathbf{k} = -v_2 \mathbf{i} + v_3 \mathbf{j} + v_3 \mathbf{k}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. The cross product \(\begin{bmatrix} 0 \\ 0 \\ 1 \end{bmatrix} \times \begin{bmatrix} -v_3 \\ -v_2 \\ -v_3 \end{bmatrix}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{vmatrix} \mathbf{i} & \mathbf{j} & \mathbf{k} \\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\ -v_3 & -v_2 & -v_3 \end{vmatrix} = (0 \cdot -v_3 - 0 \cdot -v_2) \mathbf{i} - (1 \cdot -v_3 - 0 \cdot -v_3) \mathbf{j} + (0 \cdot -v_2 - 0 \cdot -v_3) \mathbf{k} = 0 \mathbf{i} + v_3 \mathbf{j} + v_3 \mathbf{k}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So, the equation becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m (0 \mathbf{i} + v_2 \mathbf{j} - v_3 \mathbf{k}) + (-v_2 \mathbf{i} + v_3 \mathbf{j} + v_3 \mathbf{k}) + (0 \mathbf{i} + v_3 \mathbf{j} + v_3 \mathbf{k}) = c \mathbf{v}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Combine all components:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m (0 \mathbf{i} + v_2 \mathbf{j} - v_3 \mathbf{k}) + (-v_2 \mathbf{i} + v_3 \mathbf{j} + v_3 \mathbf{k}) + (0 \mathbf{i} + v_3 \mathbf{j} + v_3 \mathbf{k}) = c \mathbf{v}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Generalize:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m (0 + v_2 - v_3 + 1) \mathbf{i} + (v_3 - v_2 + v_3 + v_3) \mathbf{j} + (-v_3 + 0 - v_3 + v_3) \mathbf{k} = c \mathbf{v}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Simplify now:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m (c - 1) \mathbf{i} + (2v_3) \mathbf{j} + 0 \mathbf{k} = c \mathbf{v}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Compare:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m (c - 1) = c, \quad 2v_3 = 0, \quad 0 = c
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m From \(2v_3 = 0\), we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m v_3 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m From \(-v_3 + v_3 + 0 = 0\), we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 0 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, it simplifies:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m c - 1 = c, \quad v_3 = 0, \quad 0 = c
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We consider twice solution, equate to zero.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, simplification result:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m c = \boxed{1}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
