[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find the simplified value of \(\frac{7}{12}\dagger\frac{8}{3}\), we will use the given operation definition:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \(\frac{m}{n}\dagger\frac{p}{q} = (m)(p)\left(\frac{q}{n}\right)\)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Here, \(m = 7\), \(n = 12\), \(p = 8\), and \(q = 3\).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First, we calculate the product of \(m\) and \(p\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m m \times p = 7 \times 8 = 56
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, we calculate the product of \(q\) and \(n\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m q \times n = 3 \times 12 = 36
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, we divide the product of \(p\) and \(q\) by \(n\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \frac{q \times n}{n} = \frac{36}{12} = 3
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Finally, we combine these results to form the final answer:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \frac{7}{12}\dagger\frac{8}{3} = 56 \times (3)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, we perform the multiplication:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 56 \times 3 = 168
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the simplified value of \(\frac{7}{12}\dagger\frac{8}{3}\) is:
