[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. $320$: The sum of $189$ and another number $311$ (since $320-189=131$ and $131-189=-11$)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. $287$: The sum of $189$, $272$, and another number $461$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. $234$: The sum of $234$, $311$, and another number $277$
