[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - Therefore, $x = 234$ and $y = 277$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### Checking Pair #4 (272, 461)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - The only number $x$ that can be formed by three numbers from the set $272$, $461$, $287$ is $234$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - Therefore, $x = 234$, $y = 272$, and $x + y = 506$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### Checking Pair #5 (237 + x)
