[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Hence $r+1=-3 \times\frac{1}{2}$,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, $r=$ $\boxed{-1}$<|endoftext|>
