[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    A = 12C + 2
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 8. Now we have \( A \), \( B \), \( D \), and \( C \) in terms of \( C \). To find specific values, we need to determine \( C \). We can choose a value for \( C \) and then calculate the corresponding values of \( A \), \( B \), \( D \), and \( C \).
