[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\begin{array}{cc}9x^2+72x+4y^2-8y &= &0\\9x^2+72x &= &-4y^2+8y\\9x^2+72x+4y^2-8y &= &0\\(9x+2)^2-12^2+(2y-4)^2 &= &0\\(9x+2)^2-(12-2)^2 &= &0\\(9x+2+12)(9x+2-12) &= &0\\(9x+14)(9x-20) &= &0\\9x+14 &= &0\\9x &= &{-14}\\x &= &{-\frac{14}{9}}\\9x+2 &= &0\\9x+4 &= &12\\x &= &{5}\\x &= &{-\frac{14}{9}}\\\end{array}$
