[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now that we have \(y = 11\) and \(z = -2\), we can substitute these values into the original equations to find \(x\).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First equation: \(x + y - z = -8\)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
