[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \left(\frac{1}{2} \right)^{3} \cdot \left(\frac{1}{7} \right) &= \left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^{3} \cdot \frac{1}{7} \\
