[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m An environmental agency needs to hire a number of new employees so that 85 of the new employees will be able to monitor water pollution, 73 of the new employees will be able to monitor air pollution, and exactly 27 of the new employees will be able to monitor both. (These 27 are included in the 85 and 73 mentioned above.) What is the minimum number of employees that need to be hired?
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve this problem, we need to find the smallest potential number of employees that can be hired to meet all the given conditions. Let's denote:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - \(W\): the number of employees who can monitor water pollution
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - \(A\): the number of employees who can monitor air pollution
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - \(BC\): the number of employees who can monitor both
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We know:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ W = 85 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ A = 73 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ BC = 27 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We also know that:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ BC = W + A - BC \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Plugging in the values, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 27 = 85 + 73 - BC \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 27 = 158 - BC \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ BC = 158 - 27 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ BC = 131 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So, the minimum number of employees that need to be hired is the sum of those who can monitor water pollution, air pollution, and both, which is \(W + A - BC\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 85 + 73 - 131 = 8 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, the minimum number of employees needed to be hired is \(\boxed{8}\).<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
