[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Evaluate $|(4+2i)|\cdot|(6-3i)|$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To evaluate $(|4+2i||6-3i|)$, we will follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. Calculate the modulus of the first complex number: $|4+2i|$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. Calculate the modulus of the second complex number: $|6-3i|$  
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. Take the product of the two moduli: $|(4+2i)||6-3i|$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. Simplify the resulting expression: $|4+2i||6-3i|$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, we will follow these highlighted steps using Python code.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m  CLR Here are the computations in Python to evaluate the expression.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ```python
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m # Define first complex number
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m z1 = 4 + 2j
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m # Define second complex number
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m z2 = 6 - 3j
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m # Compute modulus of z1
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m mod_z1 = abs(z1)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m # Compute modulus of z2
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m mod_z2 = abs(z2)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m # Compute product modulus
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m product_modulus = mod_z1 * mod_z2
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m # Compute absolute value of product modulus
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m result = abs(product_modulus)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m # print the answer
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m print(f"|4+2i||6-3i| = {result}")
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ```<|endoftext|>
