[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[(x+y)^r=x^r+rx^{r-1}y^1+\frac{r(r-1)}2x^{r-2}y^2+\frac{r(r-1)(r-2)}{3!}x^{r-3}y^3+\cdots\]What are the first three digits to the right of the decimal point in the decimal representation of $\left(10^{2002}+1\right)^{10/7}$?
