[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 9^2 \equiv 81 \equiv 3 \pmod{13}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 9^4 \equiv 3^2 \equiv 9 \pmod{13}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 9^6 = (9^3)^2 \equiv 9^2 \equiv 81 \equiv 3 \pmod{13}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, the remainder when \(3^{1999}\) is divided by 13 is the same as the remainder when \(3^6\) is divided by 13, because \(1999 - 6 = 1993\). We already know this is 3, so the remainder is:
