[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So, for each of the 25 days of the week, there are a variable number of Sundays. To find the total maximum number of Sundays, we multiply the maximum possible number of Sundays by the total number of days:
