[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    ]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. **Calculate the volume of the space inside the cylinder but outside the cone:**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    The volume of the space inside the cylinder but outside the cone is the difference between the volume of the cylinder and the volume of the cone:
