[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m In the figure, point $A$ is the center of the circle, the measure of angle $RAS$ is 74 degrees, and the measure of angle $RTB$ is 28 degrees. What is the measure of minor arc $BR$, in degrees? [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m unitsize(1.2cm);
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m defaultpen(linewidth(.7pt)+fontsize(8pt));
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m dotfactor=3;
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
