[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let $p$ and $q$ be the two distinct solutions to the equation $$x^2 - 2x - 3 = 0.$$What is $(p + 1)(q + 1)$?
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve for $p$ and $q$, we start by using the quadratic formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$x = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m In our equation $x^2 - 2x -3 = 0$, we have $a = 1$, $b = -2$, and $c = -3$. So, substituting these values into the quadratic formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$x = \frac{-(-2) \pm \sqrt{(-2)^2 - 4\cdot 1\cdot (-3)}}{2\cdot 1}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$x = \frac{2 \pm \sqrt{4 + 12}}{2}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$x = \frac{2 \pm \sqrt{16}}{2}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$x = \frac{2 \pm 4}{2}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m From here, $p$ and $q$ are the two different roots of the equation.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m P+1$ can be found by plugging $x$ into the expression $(p +1)(q + 1)$:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\begin{aligned} (p + 1)(q + 1) &= [(p + 1) + 1][(q + 1) + 1] \\\ &= [(p + q + 1)^2] \\\ &= (p + 1 + q + 1)^2 \\\ &= ((p + 1) + (q + 1))^2 \\\ &= (p + q + 2)^2 \end{aligned}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, $(p + 1)(q + 1) = p + q + 2$. We can find $p$ and $q$ by using the quadratic formula.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$p = \frac{2 + \sqrt{16}}{2}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$p = 2 + 2$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$p = 4$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Similarly,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$q = ? \smallskip $$
