[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \text{odd}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m [Is Boxed Matched]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m False
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
