[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\left( a + \frac{1}{a} \right)^2 + \left( b + \frac{1}{b} \right)^2.\]Jonathon reasons as follows: By AM-GM,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[a + \frac{1}{a} \ge 2,\]and
