[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. useState() function is used to create a state variable whose initial value is an empty object. This allows us to easily iterate over the previous sides of the squares.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. Initially, the state empty object has length 0 as its key value and 0 as its initial value array. So, there is no value in the state empty object.
