[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    - Points: \( (4,3) \), \( (6,1) \), \( (1,7) \) (all at (0,0))
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    - \( d_1 = \sqrt{0^2 + 0^2} = \sqrt{0} = 0 \)
