[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    1 + 7 + 4\pi^2 + 4\pi^2 + 9 + \pi^3 + \pi + 9 = 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    Simplify the sums:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    1 + 7 + 4\pi^2 + 4\pi^2 + 9 + \pi^3 + \pi + 9 = 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    9 + 16 + 7\pi^2 + \pi^3 + \pi = 25 + 7\pi^2 + \pi^3 + \pi
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 6. **Final result**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \boxed{25 + \pi + 7\pi^2 + \pi^3}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, the value of \( f(f(1)) + f(f(2)) + \cdots + f(f(8)) + f(f(9)) \) is \( \boxed{25 + \pi + 7\pi^2 + \pi^3} \).<|endoftext|>
