[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve the problem $x - 4 < 3$ using sympy, we can either solve it algebraically:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$ x - 4 < 3$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$ x < 7$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let's use sympy to verify:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ```python
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m import sympy as sp
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m x = sp.symbols('x')
