[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let $\alpha$ and $\beta$ be complex numbers such that $|\beta| = 1$ and $\overline{\alpha} \beta \neq 1.$  Find the maximum value of
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\left| \frac{\beta - \alpha}{1 - \overline{\alpha} \beta} \right|.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let $z = \frac{\beta - \alpha}{1 - \overline{\alpha} \beta}.$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Then $\overline{z} = \frac{1}{\beta - \alpha}.$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m By the triangle inequality,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \left| \frac{\beta - \alpha}{1 - \overline{\alpha} \beta} \right| &\le 1 + \left| \frac{1}{\beta - \alpha} - \frac{1}{\beta - \alpha} \right| \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= 1.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Equality holds when $\beta - \alpha = 1,$ so the maximum value is $\boxed{1}.$ годаby (azioni)\boxed{\,}<|endoftext|>
