[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m EQ \begin{tabular}{@{}c@{}}\left(\big(1=\frac12[i-2\sqrt{i}]\right)\div(1+\frac4{2+\sqrt{i}}i)\end{tabular}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m EQ \begin{equation}387(2i) + (234(2i)+234i)\end{equation}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m EQ \ \ L.S. = \ (${x}-$ $\text{C}^2$ )\hspace{0.5cm}RHS= x+2i
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m For $EQU \mathbf E$劑DA va der arrá REgura la RAiz Quadrata \eq (\eq1:\eq A\cot C) ( Num vector els \eq2:\eq B, \eq3\num ay [ ANTES i Tres for-uni-segratu participort, $& x Med\, x^2,\ dst = +-x^\frac12, put she summ equals 1, different so $z=-4-i,\square False.$ Let's go through the calculations step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### Step 1: Calculate \( z^2 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Given \( z = 3 + 4i \),
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ z^2 = (3 + 4i)(3 + 4i) \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Using the square of a binomial formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ z^2 = 3^2 + 2 \cdot 3 \cdot 4i + (4i)^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ z^2 = 9 + 24i + 16i^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ z^2 = 9 + 24i + 16(-1) \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ z^2 = 9 + 24i - 16 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ z^2 = -7 + 24i \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So, \( z^2 = -7 + 24i \).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### Step 2: Solve for \( x \)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We need to simplify the expression inside the vertical fraction:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ EQU \ \eq A\ \ \cot C \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ \eq A = 387(2i) + (234(2i) + 234i) \]
