[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 2(i) - 468i \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### Step 3: Simplify the expression inside the vertical fraction
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
