[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ \eq EQU \ \ \ \cot C = 932 + 2i \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, we will solve for members of \( \eq (x - \sqrt{x}) \).
