[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find \( \mathbf{A}^{20} - 2 \mathbf{A}^{19} \), we first need to determine \(\mathbf{A}^{19}\). Let's calculate the sequence of powers:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \mathbf{A} = \begin{pmatrix} 2 & 3 \\ 0 & 1 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let's compute the first few powers to identify a pattern:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \mathbf{A^2} = \mathbf{A} \cdot \mathbf{A} = \begin{pmatrix} 2 & 3 \\ 0 & 1 \end{pmatrix} \cdot \begin{pmatrix} 2 & 3 \\ 0 & 1 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 4 & 5 \\ 0 & 1 \end{pmatrix}
