[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m From these calculations, we can see that \(\mathbf{A^n} = \begin{pmatrix} 2^n & 3^n \\ 0 & 1 \end{pmatrix}\). Therefore, \(\mathbf{A^{19}} = \begin{pmatrix} 2^{19} & 3^{19} \\ 0 & 1 \end{pmatrix}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
