[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To round it to the nearest tenth, we look at the digit in the hundredth place, which is 7. Since 7 is greater than or equal to 5, we round up the digit in the tenth place, which is 1. Therefore, $\frac{4}{7} \approx 0.5$. $\boxed{0.5}$<|endoftext|>
