[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Compute $\dbinom{1293}{1}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We start with $\dbinom{1}{0}$ and swap the values that put their sum equal to the total number of creatures.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\dbinom{1293}{1} = \dbinom{1290}{1}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find the total population,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\dbinom{1290}{1} = \dbinom{1291}{1} = \dbinom{1292}{1}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find the total population,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\dbinom{1292}{1} = \dbinom{1293}{1}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We know,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\dbinom{1293}{0} = 1$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Putting it all together, we get,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \dbinom{1293}{1} &= \^{\dbinom{1292}{1}}\\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \^{\dbinom{1291}{1}}\\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \^{\dbinom{1290}{1}}\\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \^{\dbinom{1290}{1}}\\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \dbinom{1290}{1}\\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \^{\dbinom{1289}{1}}\\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \^{\dbinom{1288}{1}}\\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \dbinom{1289}{1}\\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \dbinom{1290}{0} = 1
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{align*} 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore found,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \boxed{1} $)}</s>acterial infection<|endoftext|>
