[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Charlotte eats 2 tablets of vitamin D and 2 tablets of vitamin C for breakfast. Afternoon tea includes 4 tablets of vitamin D and 3 tablets of vitamin C. Lunch includes 3 tablets of vitamin D and 6 tablets of vitamin C. If she has a special occasion only on weekdays, how many tablets has she eaten in one week?
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let's break down the problem step-by-step and then write the Python code to calculate the total number of tablets Charlotte has eaten in one week.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. Breakfast consists of 2 tablets of vitamin D and 2 tablets of vitamin C.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. Afternoon tea consists of 4 tablets of vitamin D and 3 tablets of vitamin C.
