[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The solutions obtained from the symbolic computation suggest:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ a = -\frac{5}{2} - \frac{3\sqrt{149}}{2} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ b = \frac{77}{2} - \frac{13\sqrt{149}}{2} \]
