[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let's break down the multiplication step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We start with the number 98:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 98 = 9 \times 10 \times 8
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, we need to simplify this:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 9 \times 10 = 90
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m and
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 90 \times 8 = 720
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 98 = 720
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m For the number 102, we use the same method:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 102 = 10 \times 2 \times 7
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Simplify this:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 10 \times 2 = 20
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m and
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 20 \times 7 = 140
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 102 = 140
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We combine the results of the two multiplications:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 98 \times 102 = 720 \times 140
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve this, we can use the distributive property (also known as the FOIL method for binomials):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m _Distribute_:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $720 \times 140 = (72 \times 10) \times (100 \times 7)$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $720 \times 10 = 7200$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m and
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $720 \times 100 = 72000$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $720 \times 7 = 5040$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Summing these products gives:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 7200 + 72000 + 5040 = 89640
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \boxed{89640}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$<|endoftext|>
