[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Equilateral triangle $DEF$ is inscribed in equilateral triangle $ABC$ as shown with $\overline{ED}\perp\overline{BC}.$ What is the ratio of the area of $\triangle DEF$ to the area of $\triangle
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ABC$? [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m import olympiad; import geometry; size(100); defaultpen(linewidth(0.8));
