[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m A line containing the points $(9, 1)$ and $(5, 5)$ intersects the $x$ -axis at what point?
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
