[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find the point where the line $y = 9x$ intersects the $x$-axis, we simply need to solve for the value of $x$ when $y$ is $0$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Code and graph given below:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\qquad 0 = 9x \\\\ y = 9x = 1 & $\leftarrow Coordinate Plucker $(a,b,...)count:\text{ Equation }\\\\
