[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Step by step computation:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. \(\frac{2 + 6}{4^{100}} = \frac{8}{4^{100}}\)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. Multiplying by \(\frac{1}{4^{100}} = \frac{1}{4^{100+100+100+0}}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
