[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 8 \cdot \frac{1}{4^{100+201+302}} = \frac{8}{4^{603}} = 2^6 \cdot \frac{1}{4^{603}} = 64 \cdot \frac{1}{4^{603}}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
