[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - \(\sin \left( \frac{15 \pi}{180} \right) = \sin \left( \frac{\pi}{12} \right) = \frac{\sqrt{6} - \sqrt{2}}{4}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - \(\sin \left( \frac{\pi}{4} - x - \frac{35 \pi}{180} \right) = \sin \left( \frac{\pi}{4} \right) \cos \left( x + \frac{35 \pi}{180} \right) - \cos \left( \frac{\pi}{4} \right) \sin \left( x + \frac{35 \pi}{180} \right) = \frac{\sqrt{2}}{2} \cos (x + \frac{35 \pi}{180}) - \frac{\sqrt{2}}{2} \sin (x + \frac{35 \pi}{180}) = \frac{\sqrt{2}}{2} (\cos (x) \cos \left( \frac{35 \pi}{180} \right) - \sin (x) \sin \left( \frac{35 \pi}{180} \)) = \frac{\sqrt{2}}{2} \cos (x) (\cos \left( \frac{35 \pi}{180} \right) - \sin \left( \frac{35 \pi}{180} \right)) \).
