[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ \cos \left( \frac{35 \pi}{180} \right) - \sin \left( \frac{35 \pi}{180} \right) = \frac{\sqrt{2}}{2} (\cos (35^\circ) - \sin (35^\circ)), \]
