[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Here are the steps to find the remainder when $2x^6-x^4+4x^2-7$ is divided by $x^2+4x+3$:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. Divide $2x^6$ by $x^2$ to get $2x^4$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. Multiply $x^4$ by $x^2+4x+3$ to get $x^6+4x^5+3x^4$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. Subtract $4x^5+3x^4$ from $2x^6$ to get $ -x^6 + 4x^5 + 4x^2 - 7 $.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. Divide $-x^6$ by $x^2$ to get $-x^4$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 5. Multiply $-x^4$ by $x^2+4x+3$ to get $ -x^6-4x^5-3x^4$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 6. Subtract $3x^5+4x^2$ from $-x^6$ to get $ -x^6 + 4x^5-7x^2+7 $.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 7. Divide $-x^6$ by $x^2$ to get $-x^4$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 8. Multiply $-x^4$ by $x^2+4x+3$ to get $ -x^6 - 4x^5-3x^4$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 9. Subtract $3x^5+7x^2$ from $-x^6$ to get $ -x^6 + 4x^5-10x^2+7 $.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 10. Divide $-x^6$ by $x^2$ to get $-x^4$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 11. Multiply $-x^4$ by $x^2+4x+3$ to get $ -x^6-4x^5-3x^4$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 12. Subtract $4x^2+3$ from $-x^6$ to get $ -x^6 + 4x^5-1x^2+7$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 13. Divide $-x^6$ by $x^2$ to get $-x^4$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 14. Multiply $-x^4$ by $x^2+4x+3$ to get $ -x^6-4x^5-3x^4$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 15. Subtract $3x^5+7x^2$ to get $ -x^6 + 4x^5-10x^2+7 $.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 16. Divide $-x^6$ by $x^2$ to get $-x^4$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 17. Multiply $-x^4$ by $x^2+4x+3$ to get $ -x^6-4x^5-3x^4$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 18. Subtract $4x^2+3$ from $-x^4$ to get $-x^6+4x^5-10x^2-3$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 19. Divide $-x^6$ by $x^2$ to get $-x^4$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 20. Multiply $-x^4$ by $x^2+4x+3$ to get $ -x^6-4x^5-3x^4$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 21. Subtract $3x^5+7x^2$ to get $ -x^6+4x^5-10x^2-3$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 22. Divide $4x^2+7$ by $x^2$ to get $4$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 23. Multiply $4$ by $x^2+4x+3$ to get $4x^2+16x+12$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 24. Subtract $7$ from $4x^2$ to get $0$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 25. Divide $0$ by $x^2$ to get $0$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
