[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. **Set up the division:** Divide \(2x^6 - x^4 + 4x^2 - 7\) by \(x^2 + 4x + 3\).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
