[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $2(3)^4 - (3)^3 - 18(3)^2 + 14(3) + 15 = 162 - 27 - 162 + 42 + 15 = 48 \neq 0$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m For $x = -3$:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $2(-3)^4 - (-3)^3 - 18(-3)^2 + 14(-3) + 15 = 162 + 27 - 162 - 42 + 15 = 36 \neq 0$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m For $x = 15$:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $2(15)^4 - (15)^3 - 18(15)^2 + 14(15) + 15 = 1110625 - 3375 - 4950 + 210 + 15 = 1110625 - 3375 - 4950 + 210 + 15 = 1110625 - 5400 + 15 = 1105240 \neq 0$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
