[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m There are three cases:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m a. Now we can choose thirteen wobble fruits from the 30 wobble fruits.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m (b). Now we can choose thirteen red fruits from the 20 red fruits.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m (c). Now we can choose seventeen wobble fruits from the remaining 17 wobble fruits (since we already picked the first 10 wobble fruits).
