[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve this, we need to find a number, which we can denote as $x$, such that:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$(2+7i)+(x-5i) = 3-5i$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Reorganizing the expression, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$(2+7i)+(x-5i) = (3-5i) + (+7i+x)$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\Box$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$= (2+7)+(14+3i)=2+7+14+3i=21+3i$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Adding the number $(21+3i)$ to $3-5i$:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$(3-5i)+(21+3i)=3+21-5i+3i=24-i$$
