[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m And:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \cos(a - b) = \cos^{-1}\left(\frac{1}{4}\right)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Substitute these into the expressions for \(\cos(a + b)\) and \(\sin(a + b)\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \cos(a + b) = \left(\frac{1}{3}\right) \left(\frac{1}{4}\right) - \sin(a + b) \left(\frac{1}{4}\right)
