[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m This means:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m -2 < x < 2
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### Step 2: Solve the second inequality \( |x - 3| > 2 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The absolute value inequality \( |x - 3| > 2 \) can be rewritten as:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m x - 3 > 2 \quad \text{or} \quad x - 3 < -2
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Solving these two inequalities:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. \( x - 3 > 2 \)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
