[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Combining these, the integer values that satisfy both conditions are:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 5 < x < 1
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
