[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. First, we know that $x$ is given as 6. So, we substitute $x = 6$ into our expression.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \sqrt{6^2} - 3
