[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. Next, we calculate $6^2$. This means squaring 6.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 6^2 = 6 \times 6
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
