[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. We move to the expression inside the square root:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \sqrt{36}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. Now, we calculate the square root of 36.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \sqrt{36} = 6
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 5. Now we put all those calculations together:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
