[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Referring to your original definition:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### \( f(x) := \)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. **\( f \) is defined to be \( f(x) := x + 2 \).**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### \( f^{-1}(x) := \)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. **Find the inverse \( f^{-1}(x) \) of \( f(x) = x + 2 \):**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find \( f^{-1}(x) \), solve for the \( x \- \)constant from \( f(x) = x + 2 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ y = f(x) = x + 2 \implies x = y - 2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the inverse function is \( f^{-1}(x) = x - 2 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### \( g(x) := \)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. **\[ g(x) := x \over 3 \].**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### \( g^{-1}(x) := \)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. **Find the inverse \( g^{-1}(x) \) of \( g(x) = x/3 \):**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find \( g^{-1}(x) \), solve for the \( x \)-constant from \( g(x) = x/3 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ h(x) = \frac{x}{3} \implies x = 3h(x) \implies x = 3y \] (since \( y = 2x \))
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Hence, the inverse function is \( g^{-1}(x) = \frac{1}{3}x \).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### \( f(x) \): 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. Substitute \( g(x) = \frac{1}{3}x \) into \( f(x) = x + 2 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ f(g(x)) = f\left( \frac{1}{3}x \right) = \frac{1}{3}x + 2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### \( f^{-1}(x) \): 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. Substitute \( g(x) = x/3 \) into \( f(x) = x + 2 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ f(f^{-1}(x)) = f( \frac{1}{3}x - 2 ) = \frac{1}{3} \left( \frac{1}{3}x - 2 \right) + 2 \]
