[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 5p = 10000 + 5 + 125i \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 5p = 10005 + 125i \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, we solve for \( p \):
