[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If $f(x)=x^3-8$, then $f^{-1}(x)=\sqrt[3]{x}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If $f^{-1}(x)=\sqrt[3]{x}$, then $f(x)=x^3+8$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If $g(x)=x^3+8$, then $g(f^{-1}(19))=161$, so $f^{-1}\left(\left[f^{-1}(19)\right]^3-8\right)=11$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Then $(f^{-1}\left(\left[f^{-1}(19)\right]^3-8\right))^{3}=11^3$, so $11^3=19^3$.
