[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    Given \( k = \lfloor \sqrt[3]{n_1} \rfloor = \lfloor \sqrt[3]{n_2} \rfloor = \cdots = \lfloor \sqrt[3]{n_{70}} \rfloor \), it implies:
