[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. **Divisibility Condition**:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    For \( \frac{n_i}{k} \) to be maximized, \( k \) must be chosen appropriately so that it evenly divides as many \( n_i \) as possible.
