[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. **Case When \( 1 \leq i \leq 70 \)**:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    - The maximum possible \( k \) is approximately \( 144 \), as \( 16^3 = 4096 > 70 \). For \( 1 \leq i \leq 70 \), \( k \) should be close to but less than \( 4096 \).
