[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We're also given that $a \ne 13$ and $x \ne 0$. Our goal is to find the value of the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
