[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m This inequality represents a working population with a height between $7$ cm and $7 + 10 = 17$ cm, inclusive. In Python, we will use the `numpy` library to compute the area of this geometric region.
