[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 5. **Fraction of unit cubes with at least 2 painted faces**:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    The fraction of the unit cubes with at least 2 painted faces is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \frac{587}{216}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, the fraction of the unit cubes with at least 2 painted faces is \(\boxed{\frac{587}{216}}\).<|endoftext|>
