[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now we can use the property that $\sqrt[3]{a.b} = \sqrt[3]{a} \cdot \sqrt[3]{b} = ax^{\frac{a}{c}}$ 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Using this property, 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\sqrt[3]{240 \cdot 121 \cdot 47} = \sqrt[3]{240} \cdot \sqrt[3]{121} \cdot \sqrt[3]{47}$$ 
