[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Find the coefficient of the $x^2$ term in the expansion of the product $$(2x^2 +3x +4)(5x^2 +6x +7).$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let $A$ be the coefficient of $x^2$ and $B$ be the coefficient of $x^3$ in your expansion.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Using you expression $B=\sum_1^6\overbrace{\binom61}^{C_6} a_1^\binom61 a_2^\binom62 a_3^\binom63 a_4^\binom64 a_5^\binom65 a_6^\binom66}^{a_2 \binom62=a_3 \binom63}=
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \binom62\overline{abc\dots}}B_2+\binom63\overline{abc\dots}$, we get
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m B_2 =\binom62\left(\binom61\cdot 5\cdot 6\right)^2+\binom63\left(\binom61\cdot 5\right)^3
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \ ,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore,  
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m B   =2\binom62\left(\binom61\cdot5\right)^2\left(\binom61\cdot6\right)^2+\binom63\left(\binom61\cdot5\right)^3\left(\binom62\cdot6\right)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \ ,$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{eqnarray}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 9 &=& 2\cdot 210\left(\binom61\cdot5\right)^2\cdot5^2+\binom63\cdot210\cdot6^3\cdot\binom62 \\ &=& 3720\cdot5^2+720\cdot1530\cdot6 \\ &=& 3720\cdot(25+\frac{720}{6}) \\ &=& 9800
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{eqnarray}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
