[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m For $\bold{v} = \begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ 3 \\ -1 \end{pmatrix}$ and $\bold{w} = \begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ -1 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix}$, compute $\text{proj}_{\bold{w}} \bold{v}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m When you find $$u \cdot w = \langle u, w \rangle \, v,$$ it becomes clear that $$u \perp \bold{w}$$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We seek $$\text{proj}_{\bold{w}} \bold{v}=  \frac{\bold{v}}{\bold{w}}^\top \, \hat{w},$$ and automatically know that $$\bold{w}_\perp^\top \hat{w} = \bold{w}^\top \bold{v} $$ by cancellation properties.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m From the matrix multiplication operation, $$\bold{w}_\perp \,^\top \left[ \bold{v}- \frac{\bold{v}}{\bold{w}}^\top \, \bold{w}\right]$$ turns out to be the wrong move; precisely the nervous Matthew Evans should have disavowed. \\ \\ \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### $\left(\text {Matrices \,} \,-\!\right) \qquad \text{Observe}\, \left(\text {Numerical $\,Matrix \,Det$\.}\right)$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\bold{hat{w}} \, \bold{\perp} \, \, |\$ Euler's famous image \bigblackline{2} here is a lesson in.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m From \text{Matrix} multiplication,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \displaystyle\text{Trace}\,\;\, \bold{\hat{w}} &=
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \mbox{Trace}\,\left[ \bold{\hat{w}} \bold{v}- \left(\bold{v}-\bold{v/}{\bold{w}}\right)\bold{v}\right]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = \mbox{Trace}\,\left[ \bold{v}\bold{w}- \left(\bold{v/}{\bold{w}}-\bold{v}\right)\bold{v}\right]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \\[4pt]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \mbox{Trace}\,\left[\bold{v}\bold{w}(\bold{1}+\bold{w/v})\right]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m And 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{align*}
