[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m In $\triangle ABC,$ $AB=AC=25$ and $BC=23.$  Points $D,E,$ and $F$ are on sides $\overline{AB},$ $\overline{BC},$ and $\overline{AC},$ respectively, such that $\overline{DE}$ and $\overline{EF}$ are parallel to $\overline{AC}$ and $\overline{AB},$ respectively.  What is the perimeter of parallelogram $ADEF$?
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m [asy]
