[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Alice's cleaning time:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \text{Time for Alice's cleaning} = 25 \div \frac{2}{5}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = 25 \times \frac{5}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = 62.5 \text{ minutes}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Bob's cleaning time:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \text{Time for Bob's cleaning} = 62.5 \div \frac{2}{5}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = 62.5 \times \frac{5}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = 156.25 \text{ minutes}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the final answer is:
