[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4x_3 + x_1 + x_2 + x_4 = 25
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m However, since the median is 5 and there are 5 elements, the sum of the 1st, 2nd, 3rd, and 4th elements should also equal 5 * 5 / 5 = 5. Therefore:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2x_1 + x_2 + x_5 = 25
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2x_1 + x_2 = 5
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
