[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let $F(0) = 0,$ $F(1) = \frac{3}{2},$ and
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[F(n) = \frac{5}{2} F(n - 1) - F(n - 2)\]for $n \ge 2.$  Find
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\sum_{n = 0}^\infty \frac{1}{F(2^n)}.\]
