[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m After running the calculations, we can confirm our results:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \sum_{n=0}^\infty \frac{1}{F(2^n)} = \frac{1}{F(2^1)} + \frac{1}{F(2^2)}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Plugging the values:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m F(2^1) = \frac{5}{2} F(1) - F(0) = \frac{5}{2} \cdot \frac{3}{2} - 0 = \frac{15}{4}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
