[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \sum_{n=0}^\infty \frac{1}{F(2^n)} = \frac{1}{\frac{15}{4}} + \frac{1}{\frac{9}{4}} = \frac{4}{15} + \frac{4}{9}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Converting these fractions to a single step:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
