[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the final Answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \(
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m F(32) = 3F(16) - F(8)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
