[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find the sum of the first five terms in the geometric sequence \(\frac13, \frac19, \frac1{27}, \dots\), we need to compute the sum of the first five terms and recognize the structure of the geometric sequence.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First, let's write down the first five terms explicitly:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
