[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We have 25 members and we need to choose 3 from them. The number of ways to choose 3 members from 25 is given by the combination formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m C(n, k) = n! / (k!(n-k)!)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Where n is the total number of members (25) and k is the number of officers to be selected (3).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m C(25, 3) = 25! / (3!(25-3)!) = 25! / (3!22!) = 25*24*23/3*2*1 = 2300
