[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find the percentage of the human body made up of other elements besides oxygen, carbon, and hydrogen, we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. Identify the total percentage of elements in the human body.
