[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find out how many methods there are in base 10, we have to convert the base 9 method to base 10.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The method given is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 432_{9} \]
