[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To convert this number to base 10, we need to remengine the digits from right to left:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 432_{9} = 4 \times 9^2 + 3 \times 9^1 + 2 \times 9^0 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let's calculate this step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 4 \times 81 + 3 \times 9 + 2 \times 1 \]
