[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve the given equation: \(54 + \left(98 \div 14\right) + \left(23 \cdot 17\right) - 200 - \left(312 \div 6\right)\), let's break it down step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The given equation is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[54 + \left(98 \div 14\right) + \left(23 \cdot 17\right) - 200 - \left(312 \div 6\right)\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First, evaluate the division:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[98 \div 14 = 7\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So the equation becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[54 + 7 + 23 \cdot 17 - 200 - 312 \div 6\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, evaluate the multiplication:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[23 \cdot 17 = 391\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So the equation becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[54 + 7 + 391 - 200 - 312 \div 6\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, perform the division:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[312 \div 6 = 52\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So the equation becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[54 + 7 + 391 - 200 - 52\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, perform the addition and subtraction from left to right:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[54 + 7 = 61\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[61 + 391 = 452\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[452 - 200 = 252\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[252 - 52 = 200\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the value of the expression is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\boxed{200}\]<|endoftext|>
