[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. **Perform the addition and subtraction operations in sequence:**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    61 + 391 = 452
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    452 - 200 = 252
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    252 - 312\div6
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. **Perform the division operation:**
