[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Suppose $173\cdot 927\equiv n\pmod{50}$, where $0\le n< 50$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m What is the value of $n$?
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve the expression \( 173 \cdot 927 \mod 50 \mod n \( where \( 0 \le n < 50 \) \), we will do the following steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. **Calculate \( 173 \mod 50 \)**:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    173 \div 50 = 3 \quad \text{remainder} \quad 13 \quad (\text{i.e., } 173 - 50 \cdot 3 = 43)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    This means:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    173 \equiv 43 \pmod{50}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. **Calculate \( 927 \mod 50 \)**:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    927 \div 50 = 18 \quad \text{remainder} \quad 27 \quad (\text{i.e., } 927 - 50 \cdot 18 = 27)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    This means:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    927 \equiv 27 \pmod{50}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. **Multiply the results of the two results**:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    43 \cdot 27 \quad (\text{mod } 50 \text{ is equivalent to multiplying the results of the two multiplications modulo } 50) 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    Calculate \( 43 \cdot 2 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    43 \cdot 2 = 86
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    Reduce \( 86 \mod 50 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    86 \div 50 = 1 \quad \text{remainder} \quad 36 \quad (\text{i.e., } 86 - 50 \cdot 1 = 36)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    Therefore:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    43 \cdot 27 \equiv 36 \pmod{50}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. **Conclusion**:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    173 \cdot 927 \equiv 36 \pmod{50}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    Thus, \( n \) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \boxed{36}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]<|endoftext|>
