[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    19^2 = 19 \times 19 = 361
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. Next, multiply \(19\) by \(2\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    2 \times 19 = 38
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
