[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. Now, add the results from the previous two steps together:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    361 + 38 + 1 = 390
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the value of \(19^2 + 2(19) + 1\) is \(\boxed{390}\).<|endoftext|>
