[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $30 \alpha \log(\$2) - \alpha \left( e^{\log(\$2)}/2 \right)$ $=$ $30 \alpha (\log(\$2)) - \alpha \left( 1/e \right)$ $=$ $30 \alpha (\log(\$2)) - \alpha \left( 1 - 2\beta \right)$ The recurring period of "alpha" is $2 \beta$. We square this before subtracting and multiply by $S(2)$.
