[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\boxed{ -24x^3 + 288 x^2 + 144 - (-12x^2 + (-16x + 6)) }$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Combining established like terms results in:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\boxed{ -24x^3 + 288 x^2 + 144 + 12x^2 - (-16x + 6) }$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Simplifying the constants gives:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
