[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Averaging the expressions for coefficients of power of $x$:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\boxed{-24x^3 + 290 x^2 + 138 = \frac{(24x^3) x }{( (288 x^2) ) }+ \frac{(138 (-12x^2))} {( ( 144)}) }$.
