[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First, let's find the transposed matrix. The original matrix is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 \\ 0 & 1 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The transposed matrix is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\ 1 & 1 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, let's compare the transposed matrix to its position in the original matrix to find the transposed system.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The complex expressions given by the Tricky system are:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 \\ 0 & 1 \end{pmatrix} \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 3 \\ 0 & 1 \end{pmatrix} \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 5 \\ 0 & 1 \end{pmatrix} \dotsm \bigtriangledownset \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 99 \\ 0 & 1 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Notice that each element of the new matrix is the product of the corresponding elements of the original matrix by factors of 2 and 3 respectively. So, for any \(i\) from 1 to \(n\), the element in the \(i\)-th column of the new matrix is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m (1 \cdot 2)(1 \cdot 3) \dots (1 \cdot i) (1 \cdot 2 \cdot 3) \dots (1 \cdot i \cdot (i+1)) \dotsm (1 \cdot 2 \cdot 3) \dots (1 \cdot i \cdot 99) = (i+1)! \cdot (1 \cdot i)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the given complex expressions represent each element in the new matrix as \((i+1)!\) multiplied by the sum \(i=1,2,\dots,99\).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So, the answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \boxed{(1+1)!, (1+2)!, (1+3)!, \dots, (1+99)!, \dotsm}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
