[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m It takes 6 maids working 12 hours a day 3 days to wash 6 houses. How many maids are needed to wash another 6 houses in 5 days?
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let's break down the problem step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. First, we need to find out the total amount of work done in terms of "meters of roof" or "units of work". The total time taken to wash the houses is \(5 \text{ days} \times 6 \text{ days} \times 12 \text{ hours/day} = 360 \text{ hours}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. The work done in terms of the total number of meters of roof is \(6 \text{ maids} \times 3 \text{ days} \times 6 \text{ hours/day} = 54 \text{ meters of roof}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. Similarly, the work done in terms of the total number of meters of roof is also \(6 \text{ maids} \times 5 \text{ days} \times 6 \text{ hours/day} = 180 \text{ meters of roof}\), but since the number of households is the same, we can ignore the difference in staircase widths.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. Now, we know that in one day, 12 hours lasts for 6 maids. So, in one day, the total work done is \(6 \text{ maids} \times 12 \text{ hours/day} = 72 \text{ meters of roof/day}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 5. If we want to wash another 6 houses in 5 days, the total work done is \(6 \text{ houses} \times 5 \text{ days} = 30 \text{ meters of roof}/day\).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 6. The number of distinct maids needed to complete this work can be determined by the ratio of work done and the time taken. So, the number of maids needed in one day, which is 72 meters of roof per day, would require \( \frac{72 \text{ meters of roof/day}}{30 \text{ meters of roof/day}} = 2.4 \approx 3\) maids. Since we can't have a fraction of a maid, we round up to the next whole number.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let's calculate this using Python to ensure accuracy.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ```python
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m # Constants
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m maids_per_house = 6
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m days_1 = 6
