[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 你想帮我去計算下面的數據
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\begin{aligned}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \log_{\!3^2} (x-1)^{2} &=\log_{\!9} (x-1)^{2} \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &=\log_{\!9} (x-1)-\log_{\!9} (x-1) \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &= \log_{\!9} \frac{x-1}{x-1} \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m &=\log_{\!9} \left( \frac{x-1}{x-1}   \right)   \log_{\!9} 2  -\log_{\!9} 3
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{aligned}$$
