[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ------+        -----   ------
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1   1/2      2   3/4   7   5/6
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3   4/6     8   7/8   9   10/10
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We found 6 prime numbers (4 for half, 8 for sixth, and 9 for tenth) out of a total of 20 possibilities. So, the probability is around 60% / 20 = 0.3 or 30%.<|endoftext|>
