[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$4 + b = 7 + a$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$b = 3 +a$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, we substitute this expression for $b$ in the first equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$3+a=4-(3 + a)$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$3+a=4-3- a$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$3+a=1- a$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$4a=4-a$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$5a=4$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$a=\frac{4}{5}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now we can substitute this into the expression we found previously:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$3-a = 3 - \frac{4}{5} = \frac{15}{5} - \frac{4}{5} = \frac{11}{5}$$
