[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find (3-a), we need to solve the system of equations:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. (3 + a = 4 - b)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. (4 + b = 7 + a)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To isolate (3 - a) in the first equation, we add b to both sides to have (a + b) equal to 4 - b:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m [a + b = 4 - b + b]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Which simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m [a + b = 4]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Subtracting a from both sides gives us:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m b = 3
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Similarly, we recognize that:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m [4 + b = 7 + a]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m is equivalent to:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4 + 3 = 7 + a - 3
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Which simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 7 = 7 + a - 3
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Subtracting 7 from both sides yields:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 0 = a
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, we see that a = 3 and b = 3. Therefore:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3 - a = 3 - 3 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, the value of (3 - a) is 0.<|endoftext|>
