[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. From diagram, $\angle BIL = 180^\circ - 120^\circ - 10^\circ = 50^\circ$ (right angle).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. From diagram, $\angle IBL = 180^\circ - 120^\circ + 80^\circ = 40^\circ$ (angle at $B$ boundary).
