[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 5. The next best option is to replace 6 with another 6:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[9 \times 5 = 45 + 5 \times 9 = 54\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 6. One more valid configuration is to replace 8 with a 5:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[9 \times 6 = 54 + 5 \times 9 = 54\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 7. Lastly, a combination could be 7 x 6, but it gives us 82, 91. But we will replace 6 with something and reposition them to get 91, which is acceptable since it's not a four digit number.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 8. Comparing all the possibilities:
