[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ \cos(2 \angle BAD) = -1.779 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m This is also incorrect. Let's directly solve the triangle using the known side lengths and the angle relationship. Since \( AK = h \), and using the Pythagorean theorem in \( \triangle ABK \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
