[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \pi - \sin^{-1} \left( \frac{-1 + \sqrt{5}}{2} \right) \approx x_2
