[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    10 \times 20 = 200
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 8. **Conclusion**:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    Since \( 210 > 200 \), dropping 20 froods will indeed yield a greater score.
