[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Kenton watched 2000 adult men and women board a cruise ship. Half of the adults were women. If 20$\%$ of the women and 9$\%$ of the men were wearing sunglasses, what was the total number of men and women wearing sunglasses?
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
