[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find the first year after 2010 where the sum of the digits is 3 again, we need to reverse the process of finding the year where the sum of the digits is 3 for a specific year \( n \). The sum of the digits of \( n \) is 3 if and only if \( n \equiv 7 \pmod{10} \), because any multiple of 10 (Conway number) whose digits sum to 3 will always end with 7 in related sequences.
