[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We are given a condition: $$N + N^2 = 6\;.\; \Longrightarrow N(N+1) = 6\; .$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Then $$\begin{split}N^2-6 &= 0 \Leftrightarrow 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m (N-3)(N+2) &= 0\RightarrowN=3 \vee N = -2\end{split}$$
