[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let $|\beta_n|=b_n$ be a strictly decreasing sequence of absolute values rewritten  $\beta_1=1,b_1,a_1$;  $b_{n+1}=\frac{a_n - a_{n-1}}{b_n+1-b_{n+1}}$ for $a_n>0$ and $b_n>0$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Then we have $$\beta_{n+2}-b_{n+2}=a_{n+4}-1-b_{n+2}$$ therefore: $$a_{n+2}=\frac{a_{n+2}-1}{b_{n+2}+b_{n+3}-2(b_{n+1}+1)}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now:  $a_{n+2}-1$ is the complement of $a_{n+3}-1$ like $a_{n+3}-1=2a_{n}-2=a_{n+1}-a_{n}$ (simplified because $a_{n}$ is an increasing “non-vertical” sequence)= $\frac{2a_{n}-2}{b_{n}-b_{n+1}-1-b_{n+1}+b_{n+2}}=2(\frac{a_{n}-1}{b_{n}+1}-\frac{a_ {n-1}-1}{b_{n-1}+1})$  .
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\frac{2(a_{n}-1)(a_{n+2}-1)}{(b_{n}+1)(b_{n+1}+1)}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now let’s have the idea: if we can do such a thing in closed form, then we will have the simple recursive/representable algorithms: 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\beta_{n+2}-b_{n+2}=\frac{2(a_n-1)(a_{n+2}-1)}{(b_n+1)(b_{n+1}+1)}$$ 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$a_n=\frac{a_n-1}{b_n+1}-\frac{a_{n-1}-1}{b_{n-1}+1}$$
