[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The sides of triangle $PQR$ are tangent to a circle with center $C$ as shown. Given that $\angle PQR = 65^\circ$ and $\angle QRC = 30^\circ$, find $\angle QPR$, in degrees.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m unitsize(1.0 cm);
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
