[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Whichern the value of $s$ for the Obtain the sums of all the integers $n$ such that, $ \; \;\; \mid\sqrt{n} -8\mid$ is an integer.
