[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m gres the two conditions needed to satisfy for $\mid\sqrt{n} -8\mid$ to be an integer.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The two conditions are that the expression inside the square root must be either positive or negative, which means the two possibilities are that $n$ is a perfect square or a negative positive multiple of 4.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Since we need the two results of the solution, there are actually two sets of potential values to check.
