[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let's list them out manually.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If $n$ is a perfect square, we need to check when the square root equals to, or negative, the square of an integer. That means that $\sqrt{n} = k$ (the product of an integer and its conjugate) or $\sqrt{n} = -k$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
