[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2) $k$ is negative, $z = k$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m This gives us two sets of potential integer values:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
