[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2) $n = k$ and $z = k$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If we combine these two sets, we get $\{k^2, -k, k, k^2, -k, k\}$.
