[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Distance^2 = Distance^2
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
