[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let $f(x)=x^4+14x^3+52x^2+56x+16$.  Let $z_1,z_2,z_3,z_4$ be the four roots of $f$.  Find the smallest possible value of $|z_{a}z_{b}+z_{c}z_{d}|$ where $\{a,b,c,d\}=\{1,2,3,4\}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $z_1-r_1=(x_1-1)(x_1-2)(x_1-3)(x_1-4)$,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $z_2-r_2=(x_2-1)(x_2-2)(x_2-3)(x_2-4)$,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $z_3-r_3=(x_3-1)(x_3-2)(x_3-3)(x_3-4)$,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $z_4-r_4=(x_4-1)(x_4-2)(x_4-3)(x_4-4)$,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $|z_1z_2+z_3z_4|=(x_1-1)(x_2-1)+(x_2-1)(x_3-1)+(x_3-1)(x_4-1)+$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $x_1x_2x_3x_4-14(x_1+1)(x_2+1)(x_3+1)(x_4+1)$,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $=x_1x_2(x_3+1)(x_4+1)+x_1x_2(x_3+1)(x_4+1)+x_1x_2(x_3+1)(x_4+1)-$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $x_1x_2(x_3+1)(x_4+1)+x_1x_2x_3x_4-14(x_1+1)(x_2+1)(x_3+1)(x_4+1)$,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $=-x_1x_2(x_3^2+x_4^2+3x_1x_2-x_3-x_4+8)+x_1x_2(x_3^2+x_4^2+3x_1x_2-x_3-x_4+8)-$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $x_1x_2(x_3^2+x_4^2+3x_1x_2-x_3-x_4+8)+x_1x_2(x_3^2+x_4^2+3x_1x_2-x_3-x_4+8)-$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $x_1x_2(x_3^2+x_4^2+3x_1x_2-x_3-x_4+8),$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $=-x_1x_2(x_3+1)(x_4+1)+x_1x_2(x_3+1)(x_4+1)+x_1x_2(x_3+1)(x_4+1)-$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $x_1x_2(x_3+1)(x_4+1)+x_1x_2(x_3^2+x_4^2+3x_1x_2-x_3-x_4+8)-$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $x_1x_2(x_3^2+x_4^2+3x_1x_2-x_3-x_4+14).$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m As the LHS tends to zero when any of $x_1, x_2, x_3, x_4$ tends to any of roots. 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now we can consider third difference of third degree equation $x^3+nx^2+px+q=x^4+dx^3+ex^2+fx+g$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Substituting $x^3+nx^2+px+q$ values respectively :
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m -$&4x^3+4nx^2+xp-q=4x^4+4dx^3+4ex^2+4fx+4g$,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
