[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $-&3x^3+xq=x^4+7dx^3+ex^2+4fx+4g$,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m completed the square :,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $-4\left(x^3+\frac{1}{2}x-\frac{q}{16}\right)^2=-x^4+7x^2+\frac{25}{4}x^3-\frac{q}{4}$.
