[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We need to find the height \( h \).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First, substitute the given values into the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 45\pi = \pi (3)^2 h \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Simplify the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 45\pi = \pi \cdot 9 \cdot h \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Divide both sides by \( 9\pi \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ h = \frac{45\pi}{9\pi} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Simplify the fraction:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ h = \frac{45}{9} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ h = 5 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the height of the cylinder is:
