[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - On Monday, she had 3 paperclips.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - On Tuesday, she had 6 paperclips.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - On Wednesday, she had double the number of her Monday batch (which means she had 3 x 2 = 6 paperclips).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - On Thursday, she had double the number of her Tuesday batch (which means she had 6 x 2 = 12 paperclips).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - On Friday, she had double the number of her Wednesday batch (which means she had 6 x 2 = 12 paperclips).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - On Saturday, she had double the number of her Thursday batch (which means she had 12 x 2 = 24 paperclips).
