[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m At this point, we see that Jasmine had 97 paperclips on Sunday. To find out on which day she had more than 100 paperclips, we divide 100 by 7 and round up to the nearest whole number. This gives us approximately 14.2857.
