[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Simplify $\left( \frac{4}{x} \right)^{-1} \left( \frac{3x^3}{x} \right)^2 \left( \frac{1}{2x} \right)^{-3}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We will simplify the expression step by step:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. Simplify the first term:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \left( \frac{4}{x} \right)^{-1} = \frac{1}{\frac{4}{x}} = \frac{x}{4}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. Simplify the second term:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \left( \frac{3x^3}{x} \right)^2 = 3^2 \left( x^3 \right)^2 = 9x^6
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. Simplify the third term:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \left( \frac{1}{2x} \right)^{-3} = \left( \frac{1}{2x} \right)^{-3} = 2^3 \cdot x^{-3} = \frac{8}{x^3}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. Multiply the simplified terms together:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \frac{x}{4} \cdot 9x^6 \cdot \frac{8}{x^3}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 5. Combine the numerators and the denominators:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \frac{x \cdot 9x^6 \cdot 8}{4 \cdot x^3} = \frac{72x^7}{4x^3}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 6. Simplify the fraction by canceling the common factors:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \frac{72x^7}{4x^3} = \frac{72}{4} \cdot \frac{x^7}{x^3} = 18 \cdot x^{7-3} = 18x^4
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So, the simplified expression is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \boxed{18x^4}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
