[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m A translation of the plane takes $-3 + 2i$ to $-7 - i.$  Find the complex number that the translation takes $-4 + 5i$ to.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The translation of $-3 + 2i$ to $-7 - i$ requires a complex conjugate and a multiplication by $-1$. We can write:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m T(1) = a + ib = -4 + 5i \leftarrow -4 \text{ means add } i \times -4,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m T(6) = a + ib \leftarrow -3 + 2i \text{ means add } i \times 3,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m T(5) = a + ib = 6 + -7i \leftarrow 1 \text{ means add } 1 \times i.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, the translated $-4 + 5i$ is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m T(5) = (1)(6) + (-7)(-4)i + (1)(-3) + (1)(2)i,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m which simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m (1)(6) + (-7)(4) + 5(-3) + 5(2i) = 6 - 28 - 15 + 10i = -17 - 10i.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We will now verify this by calculating $T(5)$ using Python to ensure accuracy.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ```python
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m # Function to perform the translation
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m def translate(z, T):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m     a, b = z
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m     return a + b*T
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m # Values
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m origin_z = 1+0j
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m point_z = -4-5j
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m point_value = 1+6j
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m # Translation
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m translation = translate(point_z, point_value)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m print((point_z, translation))
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ```
