[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m If \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4x-y+2z&=7,\\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 6x+3y+3z&=5,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{align*} compute $y$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve the given system of equations using Python and SymPy:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4x - y + 2z &= 7 \quad \mathrm{(1)} \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 6x + 3y + 3z &= 5 \quad \mathrm{(2)}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m we can use the method of elimination. First, we will eliminate \( z \) by subtracting Equation (2) from Equation (1) to eliminate \( y \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{align}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4x - y + 2z &= 7 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 6x + 3y + 3z &= 5 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \hline
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4x - 4x + 2z - 3y + 3z &= 7 - 5 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m -y + z &= 2 \quad \mathrm{(3)}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{align}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, we solve for \( y \) in Equation (3):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m y = z + 2
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now we substitute \( y = z + 2 \) into any of the original equations to find \( x \). Let's use Equation (1):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4x - (z + 2) + 2z = 7
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Simplify and solve for \( z \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4x - z - 2 + 2z = 7 \implies 4x + z - 2 = 7 \implies 4x + z = 9 \quad \mathrm{(4)}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, we substitute \( y = z + 2 \) and \( x = \frac{3}{2}z \) into Equation (2):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 6\left(\frac{3}{2}z\right) + 3(z + 2) + 3z = 5
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Simplify and solve for \( z \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 7z + 3z + 6 + 3z = 5 \implies 13z + 6 = 5 \implies 13z = -1 \implies z = -\frac{1}{13}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now substitute \( z = -\frac{1}{13} \) back into the expression for \( y \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m y = z + 2 = -\frac{1}{13} + 2 = \frac{-\frac{1}{13} + \frac{26}{13}}{13} = \frac{25}{13}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now substitute \( y = -\frac{1}{13} + 2 \) and \( z = -\frac{1}{13} \) back into Equation (4):
