[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve this problem, we will start by isolating the variables in the given equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[10xy + 14x + 15y = 166\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 14x + 15y = 166 - 10xy\]
