[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Compute \[ \left\lfloor \dfrac {2005^3}{2003 \cdot 2004} - \dfrac {2003^3}{2004 \cdot 2005} \right\rfloor,\]where $\lfloor x \rfloor$ denotes the greatest integer less than or equal to $x.$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve the problem, we can simplify the expression using the difference of squares formula, \(\left(a^2 - b^2\right) = \left(a+b\right)\left(a-b\right)\), where \(a = 2003\) and \(b = 2004\). The expression we need to find the value of is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \left\lfloor \dfrac {2005^3}{2003 \cdot 2004} - \dfrac {2003^3}{2004 \cdot 2005} \right\rfloor
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Using the difference of squares formula, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \left(\dfrac {2005^3}{2003 \cdot 2004} - \dfrac {2003^3}{2004 \cdot 2005}\right) = \dfrac {2005^3 - 2003^3}{2004 \cdot 2005}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, we calculate \(2005^3 - 2003^3\) using the difference of cubes formula: \(a^3 - b^3 = (a-b)(a^2 + ab + b^2)\). Substituting \(a = 2005\) and \(b = 2003\), we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2005^3 - 2003^3 = (2005 - 2003)(2005^2 + 2005 \cdot 2003 + 2003^2) = 2 \cdot (2005^2 + 2005 \cdot 2003 + 2003^2)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = 2 \cdot (2005^2 + 2005^2 \cdot 2003 + 2005^2 + 2005 \cdot 2003 + 2003^2) = 2 \cdot (2005(2005 + 2003) + 2005^2 + 2003^2)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = 2 \cdot (2005 \cdot 4008 + 2005^2 + 2003^2) = 2 \cdot 2005(4008 + 2003) = 2 \cdot 2005 \cdot 6011 = 2502120
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the expression inside the floor function is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \dfrac {2502120}{2004 \cdot 2005} = \dfrac {2502120}{2004 \cdot 2005} = \dfrac {2502120}{4017270} = \dfrac {2502120}{4017270} = 63.5
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \(\lfloor 63.5 \rfloor = 63\)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \boxed{63}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
