[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Solve these linear equations to get the components:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[c_{3} = 7, \qquad c_{2} = -2, \qquad c_{1} = 2.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\mathbf{a} - \mathbf{b} = \begin{pmatrix} -3 \\ 10 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix} + \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ -\pi - 2 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ 8 \\ \pi + 1 \end{pmatrix}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, evaluate $\mathbf{b} - \mathbf{c}$:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\mathbf{b} - \mathbf{c} = \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ \pi \\ 0 \end{pmatrix} - \begin{pmatrix} -2 \\ -2 \\ 7 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 7 \\ \pi + 2 \\ -7 \end{pmatrix}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Then, next compute:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\mathbf{b} - \mathbf{c}\times (\mathbf{c} - \mathbf{a}): \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Evaluate element-wise:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\mathbf{b} - \mathbf{c} = \begin{pmatrix} 7 \\ \pi + 2 \\ -7 \end{pmatrix}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\mathbf{c} - \mathbf{a} = \begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ -3 + 10 - 1 \\ 0 - 2 - 3 \end{pmatrix}.\]
