[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 4 \text{ glasses} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 4 \text{ choices for glasses} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The total possible pairings are calculated as:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ 4 \text{ b bowls x } 4 \text{ glasses} \]
