[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, the base-7 representation of 1 in decimal is 1121.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The given remainders, in reverse order, give us 11121.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Finally, check for even digits in our representation: 1, 1, and 2 are all odd digits. So, the number of even digits in the base-7 representation of 403 in decimal is 3.
