[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let $f(n)$ be the base-10 logarithm of the sum of the elements of the $n$th row in Pascal's triangle. Express $\frac{f(n)}{\log_{10} 2}$ in terms of $n$. Recall that Pascal's triangle begins
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{tabular}{rccccccccc}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $n=0$:& & & & & 1\\\noalign{\smallskip\smallskip}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $n=1$:& & & & 1 & & 1\\\noalign{\smallskip\smallskip}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $n=2$:& & & 1 & & 2 & & 1\\\noalign{\smallskip\smallskip}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $n=3$:& & 1 & & 3 & & 3 & & 1\\\noalign{\smallskip\smallskip}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $n=4$:& 1 & & 4 & & 6 & & 4 & & 1\\\noalign{\smallskip\smallskip}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m & & & & & $\vdots$ & & & &
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{tabular}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 计算$\frac{f(n)}{\log_{10} 2}$我们需要分步骤进行计算：
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. 观察$\left(f(n)\right)$与$\left(\dfrac{f(n)}{\log_{10} 2}\right)$的项数关系：
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - 从第$n$行得出$\left(\dfrac{f(n)}{\log_{10} 2}\right)$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - $n-1$过程中，数字的个数增加了$n-1$个，并且前$n-2$行中占有的数字个数是$\dfrac{n(n+1)}{2}$，即 $\dfrac{1}{2} \times n(n+1)$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - 因此，$\left(f(n)\right)$通过将$n-1$行下移$n-1$个元素+额外的占有的元素，得到多项式的形式 $\dfrac{1}{2} \times n^2 \left( 1 + \dfrac{1}{2} \right)$，这时把$\dfrac{1}{2}$下降为1，就是 $\dfrac{1}{2}n^2$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - $\left(f(n)\right)$更新为$\dfrac{1}{2}n^2$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - 第$n$行结束出$1$:  
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - n+1,即$\left(\dfrac{f(n)}{\log_{10}2}\right)$,是因为第$n+1$行根据$n$和$\log_{10}2$扩展： 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. 统计$\left(f(n)\right)$和$\left(\dfrac{f(n)}{\log_{10}2}\right)$的式子：
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 我们需要将两个式子化简后得到$f(n)$：
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $f(n) = \log_{10}(\left(\dfrac{1}{2}n^2\right) + 1) = \log_{10} \left(\left(\dfrac{\left(\sqrt{2n} - 1\right)^2}{2}\right) + 1\right) = \log_{10}2$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. 把$f(n)$和$\dfrac{f(n)}{\log_{10}2}$合并：
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\dfrac{f(n)}{\log_{10}2} = \dfrac{\log_{10}2}{\log_{10}(1)} = \log_{10} 2$<|endoftext|>
