[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $ABCD$ is a trapezoid with the measure of base $\overline{AB}$ twice the measure of the base $\overline{CD}$. Point $E$ is the point of intersection of the diagonals. The measure of diagonal $\overline{AC}$ is 11. Find the length of segment $\overline{EC}$. Express your answer as a common fraction.
