[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To simplify this expression, focus on the numerators and denominators separately:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Initial value: $\dfrac{18}{17}\cdot\dfrac{13}{24}\cdot\dfrac{68}{39}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. Multiply the numerators: $18 \times 13 \times 68$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    18 \times 13 &= 234 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    234 \times 68 &= 15692
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. Multiply the denominators: $17 \times 24$ and $39$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    17 \times 24 &= 408 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    39 &= 39 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \times &= 39
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. Cancel common factors between the numerator and denominator (if any).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m While we can cancel common factors, in this case there are no common factors left.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, the simplified form of the expression is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \boxed{\dfrac{15692}{408 \times 39}}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To confirm its accuracy, substitute $x = \dfrac{15692}{408 \times 39}$. 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Given:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \dfrac{18}{17}\cdot\dfrac{13}{24}\cdot\dfrac{68}{39} = \dfrac{234}{408 \times 39}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Simplifying, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \boxed{1}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
