[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Since \( \frac{199}{2} = 99.5 \), approximately:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \lfloor 1991 + 99.5 \approx 1991 + 99.5 = 2090.5
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Then applying the floor function:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \lfloor 2090.5 \rfloor = 2090
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, consider \(\lfloor 1991 + \frac{198}{2} \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \frac{198}{2} = 99
