[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \lfloor 1991 + 99 \approx 1991 + 99 = 2090
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Applying the floor function:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \lfloor 2090 \rfloor = 2090
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, extend this pattern to \(\lfloor 1991 + \frac{1}{2} \):
