[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m However, the actual brooch area must be exactly minimized such that it fits exactly into the brooch without exceeding 5184 square inches. So, the largest area of the brooch itself is 58 since it fits perfectly within the brooch area.
