[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find the difference between $1000_7$ and $666_7$ in base $7$, we need to perform the following operations:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Step 1: Convert $1000_7$ to base $10$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We can convert $1000_7$ to base $10$ by expanding it:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $1000_7 = 1 \times 7^3 + 0 \times 7^2 + 0 \times 7^1 + 0 \times 7^0 = 1 \times 343 + 0 \times 49 + 0 \times 7 + 0 = 343_{10}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Step 2: Convert $666_7$ to base $10$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We can convert $666_7$ to base $10$ by expanding it:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $666_7 = 6 \times 7^2 + 6 \times 7^1 + 6 \times 7^0 = 6 \times 49 + 6 \times 7 + 6 = 294 + 42 + 6 = 342_{10}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Step 3: Subtract $342_{10}$ from $343_{10}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $343_{10} - 342_{10} = 1_{10}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The difference between $1000_7$ and $666_7$ in base $7$ is $1_{7}$.
