[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m           8 + a - 3 &= a + 7
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, solving this step-by-step helps us find the value of $a$. We can verify the solution by plugging the values back into the expressions to ensure they hold true.
