[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    Using these results,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \sin 22^\circ \cos 8^\circ = \sin (p+q) = \sin p \cos q + \cos p \sin q
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    And
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
