[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, the value of \( x \) that satisfies \( f_{1001}(x) = x - 3 \) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \boxed{4}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
