[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Suppose $p(x)$ is a function such that $p(x) + (x^5+3x^3+9x) = (7x^3+24x^2+25x+1)$.  Express $p(x)$ as a polynomial with the degrees of the terms in decreasing order.
