[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We want to find the value of $a_{100}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Given that $a_0 = 6$ and $a_n = \frac{a_{n - 1}}{1 + a_{n - 1}}$ for all $n \ge 1$, we can write the following relationship:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $a_n = 1 + a_{n - 1}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Using this, we can calculate the first few terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $a_1 = 1 + a_0 = 1 + 6 = 7$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $a_2 = 1 + a_1 = 1 + 7 = 8$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $a_3 = 1 + a_2 = 1 + 8 = 9$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $a_4 = 1 + a_3 = 1 + 9 = 10$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $a_5 = 1 + a_4 = 1 + 10 = 11$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $a_6 = 1 + a_5 = 1 + 11 = 12$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $a_7 = 1 + a_6 = 1 + 12 = 13$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $a_8 = 1 + a_7 = 1 + 13 = 14$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $a_9 = 1 + a_8 = 1 + 14 = 15$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $a_10 = 1 + a_9 = 1 + \infty$ because any number greater than 1 must eventually reach infinity.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We can see that the values of $a_n$ are getting larger and larger, but we can repeat the process $n-1$ more times to get the last term.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $a_{100} = 1 + a_{99} = 1 + \infty$ because any number greater than 1 does eventually reach infinity.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the value of $a_{100}$ is $\boxed{\infty}$.
