[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    w + x + y + z = 44
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    Additionally, since the differences are \(\{1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 9\}\), it implies:
