[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m It seems like the direct symbolic solution didn't yield a result, so let's manually verify the solution we found by solving the system of equations again. The solution we derived manually is correct:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
