[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. **Calculate the length of the common chord when each circle has a radius of 10 cm.**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. **When one of the circles has a radius of 10 cm and the other has a radius of 10 cm, the length of the chord would be \(9\sqrt{11}\) cm.
