[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \alpha + \gamma = -i
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m This is the same as Equation 1.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### Step 3: Simplifying the Equations
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m From Equation 1:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
