[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### Step 4: Magnitudes Condition
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To minimize \( | \alpha | + |\gamma | \), we need to find the smallest possible values of \(\alpha\) and \(\gamma\). From Equation 1:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
