[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Solving the equations you get: you get
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\dfrac { x } { 3 } - \dfrac { 1 } { 6 } y = \dfrac { 5 } { 24 } $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\dfrac { x } { 2 } + y = \dfrac { 2 } { 3 } - \dfrac { 5 } { 3 } $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Multiply the denominator in the second equation by 6, lets multiply it by 4 to be able to get rid the 4 in front of the y that you need
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\dfrac { x } { 4 } + 6y = \dfrac { 4 } { 3 } - \dfrac { 10 } { 3 } $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$4\cdot \dfrac { x } { 4 } + 6\cdot \dfrac { 1 } { 3 } y = 4\cdot \dfrac { 4 } { 3 } - 4\cdot \dfrac { 10 } { 3 }$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$x + 2y = \dfrac { 16 } { 3 } - \dfrac { 40 } { 3 } $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$x + 2y = \dfrac { - 24 } { 3 } $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now we need to solve for the y and we get
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$y = \dfrac { - 24 } { 3 } - x $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Then you can solve for x
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$x = \dfrac { - 24 } { 3 } - \dfrac { - 24 } { 3 } y $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$x = \dfrac { - 24 } { 3 } - \dfrac { 24 } { 3 } y$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\Rightarrow y = \dfrac { - 24 } { 3 } - \dfrac { - 24 } { 3 } x$$
