[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m B++¨ class methodology pointed out that `the only reason that we use an API layer in a program is to provide an abstraction of many common elements for end users of the application` and is eligible for program critical parts or parts that deal with the user data. `The coverage of an API for a method is the amount of information that API and consumers can use to divide any API statement into small sections that fit well into a page. For an API that is used by a variety of different applications, APIs that avoid repetitive information provide a shorthand and speed up development. For one API, a method can describe many other APIs's operations that could ultimately be performed thanks to it being the bridge between the public API content and application logic`
