[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 定理:如果$a,b,c$ 是正实数, $\frac{1}{a}+\frac{1}{b}+\frac{1}{c}\geqslant \frac{9}{a+b+c}$,$\frac{1}{a}+\frac{1}{b}+\frac{1}{c}\geqslant \frac{9}{6}=\frac{3}{2}.$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 由定理可得 $\frac{1}{x}+\frac{1}{y}\geqslant \frac{1}{2\sqrt{\frac{1}{x}} • \frac{1}{y}}=\frac{2}{\sqrt {xy}}.$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 由题中所给条件得 $2xy\leqslant 100,$ 得 $xy\leqslant 50$,$x+y\geqslant 10,$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m  所以 $\frac{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}{2xy}+\frac{2xy}{x+y}\geqslant \frac{2}{50}$,$\frac{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}{2xy}+\frac{2xy}{x+y}\geqslant \frac{2}{50}$, 所以 $\frac{x^{2}+y^{2}}{2xy}\geqslant \frac{2}{50}+ \frac{1}{2}=\frac{4}{5}$, 当且仅当 $x=y= \frac{5}{\sqrt{10}}$.<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
