[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    - The superimposition of \( f(x) \) and \( g(x) \) results in the graph of \( y = \cos(wx + \frac{\pi}{6}) + \frac{5}{4} = f(x) + g(x) \).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 5. **Determine the resulting operation**: The resulting graph after superimposing \( f(x) \) and \( g(x) \) is the graph of \( f(x) + g(x) \).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
