[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $121_5$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - The number $0$ remains $0$ in base ten.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - The number $1$ in base five is $1 \times 5^1 = 5$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - The number $2$ in base five is $2 \times 5^1 = 10$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - The number $1$ in base five is $1 \times 5^1 = 5$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So, convert $121_5$:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
