[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### Step 2: Add the two base ten numbers
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 15_{10} + 6_{10} = 21_10
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### Step 3: Convert $11_5$ back to base five
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We already know that $11_5 = 6_{10}$ and $21_10 = 01001_5$ (since $15_{10}$ because we write it as $0\cdot5^1 + 1\cdot5^0$).
