[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The coefficient of the $x^2$ term comes from the term: $21abx^2$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the coefficient of the $x^2$ term is $21ab$.<|endoftext|>
