[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    x_1 = -1 + \sqrt{217} \, (1)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
