[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    x_3 = \frac{46 + \sqrt{528}}{8} \, (3)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, the unique solution to the equation is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m x = -1 - \sqrt{528}
