[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, compute \(\mathbf{a} - \mathbf{b}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \mathbf{a} - \mathbf{b} = \begin{pmatrix} -3 \\ 10 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix} - \begin{pmatrix} -96 \\ \pi + 2 \\ -1 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -3 + 96 \\ 10 - (\pi + 2) \\ 1 + 1 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 93 \\ 8 - \pi \\ 2 \end{pmatrix}
