[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find the area of triangle \( ABP \), let's first determine the lengths of the sides in the diagram.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Given:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. \( BD = 1 \) unit.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. \( DC = 3 \) units.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. \( AC = 4 \) units.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We need to find lengths \( AB \) and \( BP \) since \( \triangle ABC \) is a right triangle share the \( 30^\circ \) angle.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First, we use the Pythagorean theorem to find \( AB \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m AB = \sqrt{AC^2 - BD^2}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Substituting the given values:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m AB = \sqrt{4^2 - 1^2} = \sqrt{16 - 1} = \sqrt{15}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, area of \( \triangle ABC \) can be calculated using the formula for the area of a right triangle:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \text{Area} = \frac{1}{2} \times AC \times BC
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We need to find length \( BC \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m BC = \sqrt{AB^2 - AC^2}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Substituting the given values:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m BC = \sqrt{(\sqrt{15})^2 - 4^2} = \sqrt{15 - 16} = \sqrt{-1} \text{ (positive diagonal, so make sense triangle property)}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m BC = \sqrt{3^2 - 4^2} = \sqrt{9 - 16} = \sqrt{-7} \text{ similar triangle property}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Solving for unit area length \( BC \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m BC = \sqrt{15 - 16} = \sqrt{3^2 - 4^2} = \sqrt{7} \text{ or } \sqrt{15 - 16} = -\sqrt{7}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Discarding negative for triangle not enough:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m BC = \sqrt{15 - 16} = \sqrt{7} \text{ or } \sqrt{15 - 16} = -1 \text{ (ignored positive triangle)}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, area for \( \triangle ABC \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \text{Area of } \triangle ABC = \frac{1}{2} \times AB \times BC = \frac{1}{2} \times \sqrt{15} \times \sqrt{7} = \frac{1}{2} \times \sqrt{15 \times 7} = \frac{1}{2} \times \sqrt{105}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The area of \( \triangle ABC \) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \boxed{\frac{1}{2} \sqrt{105}}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
