[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. Pair the x-coordinates (left and right vertices) and the y-coordinates (top and bottom vertices) from these coordinates:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \begin{array}{c|c}
