[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m C & 2 & (0, -3) \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m D & 0 & (-1, 0) \\
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \end{array}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. Apply the Shoelace formula formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \text{Area} = \frac{1}{2} \left| \sum_{i=1}^{n-1} (x_i y_{i+1} + x_{i+1} y_i) \right|
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
