[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We also need to use the Law of Cosines to find the angle:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ \cos(ANGLE(XXX)) = \frac{16^2 + 29^2 - 24^2}{2 \cdot 16 \cdot 29} \]
