[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To simplify the given expression $\dfrac{18}{17}\cdot\dfrac{13}{24}\cdot\dfrac{68}{39}$, we can combine the numerators and denominators into a single fraction:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\dfrac{18 \cdot 13 \cdot 68}{17 \cdot 24 \cdot 39}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, we can simplify the product of the numerators and denominators individually:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - Numerators:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$18 \cdot 13 = 234$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$68 \cdot 24 = 1632$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Final numerators: 234, 1632
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - Denominators:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$17 \cdot 24 = 408$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$39 \cdot 1 = 39$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Final denominators: 408, 39
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now we can multiply these simplified terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\dfrac{234 \cdot 1632}{408 \cdot 39}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, we can divide the numerators and denominators:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\dfrac{234 \cdot 1632}{408 \cdot 39} = \dfrac{234 \cdot 16}{408 \cdot 9}$$
