[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve for \(a_2\), we need to understand the relationship between this sequence and the arithmetic mean of the first \(n-1\) terms. Given that \(a_n\) is the arithmetic mean of the first \(n-1\) terms, we can write:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m a_n = \frac{a_1 + a_2 + \cdots + a_{n-1}}{n-1}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Since \(a_n\) is the arithmetic mean of the first \(n-1\) terms, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m a_n = \frac{a_1 + a_2 + \cdots + a_{n-1}}{n-1}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Given:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - \(a_1 = 19\)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - \(a_9 = 99\)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First, we find the sum of the terms from \(a_2\) to \(a_9\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m a_2 + a_3 + \cdots + a_9
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Using the arithmetic mean equation for \(n = 9\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m a_9 = \frac{a_1 + a_2 + \cdots + a_8}{8}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Substitute \(a_9 = 99\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 99 = \frac{19 + a_2 + \cdots + a_8}{8}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find \(a_2 + a_3 + \cdots + a_9\), we multiply both sides by 8:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 99 \times 8 = 19 + a_2 + \cdots + a_8
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Simplify:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 792 = 19 + a_2 + \cdots + a_8
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, we need to find the sum of the first \(8\) terms of the arithmetic sequence starting from \(a_2\) and increasing by 1 with each subsequent term:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m a_2 = a_1 + d = 19 + d
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m a_3 = a_2 + d = 19 + d + 1 = 20 + d
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m a_4 = a_3 + d = 20 + d + 1 = 21 + d
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \cdots
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m a_8 = a_2 + 7d = (19 + d) + 7d = 26 + 8d
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So, the sum of the first \(8\) terms is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 792 = 19 + (d + 1 + 19 + d + 1 + d + 1) + (d + 26 + 8d)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 792 = 19 + 8d + (d + 26 + 8d) + (d + 1 + 19 + 1)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 792 = 19 + 8d + 8d + 8d + d + 11 + 19 + 1
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 792 = 19 + 8d + 8d + 8d + d + 11 + 19 + 1
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 792 = 88 + 24d
