[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m However, since \(a_2\) must be an integer, we recheck the arithmetic:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
