[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m What is the coefficient of $x^8$ in the expansion of $(x-1)^9$?
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To determine the coefficient of \(x^8\) in the expansion of \((x-1)^9\), we will use the binomial theorem. The binomial theorem states that:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m (a + b)^n = \sum_{k=0}^{n} \binom{n}{k} a^{n-k} b^k
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m In this case, \(a = x\), \(b = -1\), and \(n = 9\). We are interested in the term where the power of \(x\) is 8, so \(k = 8\). The general term in the expansion is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \binom{9}{k} x^{9-k} (-1)^k
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We set \(k = 8\) to find the coefficient of \(x^8\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \binom{9}{8} x^{9-8} (-1)^8
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Simplify the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \binom{9}{8} x^1 (-1)^8
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \binom{9}{8} x
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We know that \(\binom{9}{8} = \binom{9}{1} = 9\), so:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 9x
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, the coefficient of \(x^8\) in the expansion of \((x-1)^9\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \boxed{9}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
