[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Given:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ f(x) = 2x + 1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ g(x) = -3 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First, we need to evaluate \( g(-3) \):
