[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = $\sqrt[3]{12 \times \sqrt[3]{a^2}} \times \sqrt[3]{\sqrt[3]{b \times d \times 2}}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = $\sqrt[3]{\sqrt[3]{14} \times \sqrt[3]{\frac{a^2}{d}} \times \sqrt[3]{2b}}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Step 4: Combine the cube root of each factor plus the constant.
