[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, $\sqrt[3]{12}\times \sqrt[3]{20}\times \sqrt[3]{15}\times \sqrt[3]{60} = \boxed{\sqrt[3]{14} \times \sqrt[3]{\frac{a^2}{d}} \times \sqrt[3]{2b}}$.<|endoftext|>
