[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m # From ar^2 = 1, we get r^2 = 1, so r = ±1
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m # We can use either r = 1 or r = -1 because both solutions will give the same a8 = a4 + 3a5
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m # Since the terms in the geometric sequence are positive and there is a third term added to the sum:
