[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m After preparing 28 hot snacks and 32 cold snacks, Jess ordered a courier to ship the snacks. However, due to some unforeseen circumstances, she had to double the number of cold snacks she ordered. If the courier can ship all the hot snacks but only half the cold snacks, how many items does the courier need to ship back?
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To determine how many items the courier needs to ship back, we first need to find out the total number of snacks Jess ordered and then adjust for the courier's meal portions.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. Calculate the total number of snacks Jess ordered initially:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    28 \text{ hot snacks} + 32 \text{ cold snacks} = 60 \text{ snacks}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. Determine how many cold snacks the courier handles, considering Jess doubled the number of cold snacks:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \text{Number of cold snacks Jess ordered doubled} = 32 \times 2 = 64 \text{ cold snacks}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. Find out how many cold snacks the courier handles in the special case where Jess doubles the number:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \text{Number of cold snacks the courier handles} = 64 - 32 - 28 = 6 \text{ cold snacks}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. Calculate the number of hot snacks the courier handles:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \text{Number of hot snacks the courier handles} = 60 - 6 = 54 \text{ hot snacks}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 5. Determine how many items the courier needs to ship back for the hot snacks:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    54 \text{ hot snacks} = 54 \text{ items to ship back}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, the courier needs to ship \(\boxed{54}\) items back.
