[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let $a,$ $b,$ $c$ be positive real numbers.  Find the minimum value of
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\frac{(a + b)(a + c)(b + c)}{abc}.\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find the minimum value of 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\frac{(a + b)(a + c)(b + c)}{abc},\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m let's set up a Maclaurin series expansion for \(\frac{1}{(1 - x)}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m f(x) = \frac{1}{(1 - x)} = \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} x^k
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We want to find \(\frac{a + b}{abc}\) by substituting \(x = a + b\) in the series:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \frac{a + b}{abc} = \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} \frac{(a + b)^k}{(abc)^{k+1}} \cdot b^{k+1}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \frac{a + b}{abc} = \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} \frac{(a + b)^k}{(abc)^{k}} \cdot b^{k+1} = \frac{1}{bc} \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} \frac{(a + b)^k}{abc^{k}} \cdot b^k
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = \frac{1}{bc} \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} \frac{(a + b)^k}{(abc)^{k}} \cdot \frac{b^{k+1}}{b^{k+1}}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Since \(\frac{b}{b^k} = b^{k-1}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = \frac{1}{bc} \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} \frac{(a + b)^k}{(abc)^{k}} \cdot \frac{b^{k+1}}{b^{k+1}}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = \frac{1}{bc} \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} \frac{(a + b)^k b^{k+1}}{(abc)^{k+1}}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = \frac{1}{bc} \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} \frac{(b + b^{k+1})(a + b^k)}{(abc)^{k+1}}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let's expand this:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = \frac{1}{bc} \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} \frac{b^k a + b^{k+1} b^k}{abc^{k+1}}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = \frac{1}{bc} \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} \frac{b^k a + b^{2k+1}}{abc^{k+1}}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = \frac{1}{bc} \left( \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} \frac{a}{abc} + \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} \frac{b^{2k+1}}{abc^{k+1}} \right)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = \frac{1}{bc} \left( \frac{a}{abc} + \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} \frac{b^{2k+1}}{(abc)^{k+1}} \right)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m = \frac{1}{bc} \left( \frac{1}{b} + \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} \frac{1}{(abc)^{k+1}} \right)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
