[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The side lengths of both triangles to the right are given in centimeters. What is the length of segment $AB$?
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m pair A,B,C,D,E,F,G;
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m A=(0,0);
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m B=12*dir(0);
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m C=20*dir(120);
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m D=8+B;
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m E=D+6*dir(0);
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m F=D+10*dir(120);
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m draw(A--B--C--cycle);
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m draw(D--E--F--cycle);
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m label("A",F,N);
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m label("B",E+(1.4,0));
