[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. Identify the weight of the module: 250 g
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. Identify the cost per kilogram: \$22,000
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. Multiply the weight of the module by the cost per kilogram:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    250 \, \text{g} \times 22,000 \, \text{dollars/g}
