[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[(1002^2 - 502^2) + (298^2 - 202^2) = 1504 \cdot 500 + 500 \cdot 96\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
