[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find the remainder when 2007 is divided by 81, we can use the property of divisibility by 81. The process involves finding the remainder of each digit in 2007, ultimately focusing on the last digit since we are interested in the remainder.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let's apply this method to find the remainder:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. Start by finding the remainder of 2 for both 2007 and 0.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    2007 \div 81 = 25 \text{ remainder } 22
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    2007 = 2 \times 81^2 + 22 \times 81
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    Thus,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    2007 \equiv 22 \mod 81
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. Find the remainder of 0 for both 2 and 0007.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    2 + 0007 = 0009 \equiv 9 \mod 81
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    2 + 0007 = 81 \times 10 + 297 \log_{10} 297 = 81 \times 10 + 297 \text{ digit}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    Since we are only interested in the last digit, we focus on the digit 9 in the initial processing:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### Final Answer:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \boxed{229}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m This is because we only need the last digit of the remainder after the division, which is 9. Thus, the remainder when 2007 is divided by 81 is 9.<|endoftext|>
