[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, let's find \( c \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ c = a_{10} + a_{11} + a_{12} + a_{13} + a_{14} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ c = \dfrac{1}{\log_{10} 2002} + \dfrac{1}{\log_{10} 2002} + \dfrac{1}{\log_{10} 2002} + \dfrac{1}{\log_{10} 2002} + \dfrac{1}{\log_{10} 2002} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ c = 5 \dfrac{1}{\log_{10} 2002} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Finally, we compute \( b - c \):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ b - c = 4 \dfrac{1}{\log_2 2002} - 5 \dfrac{1}{\log_{10} 2002} \]
