[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ b - c = 4 \dfrac{1}{\log_2 2002} - \dfrac{5}{\log_2 2} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ b - c = 4 \dfrac{1}{\log_2 2002} - \dfrac{3}{\log_2 2} \]
