[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \overrightarrow{P}_1 = \overrightarrow{A} - \overrightarrow{B} + \overrightarrow{C} + \overrightarrow{C} = \overrightarrow{P}_1
