[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, substitute \(a^2\) and \(b^2\) with their expressions in terms of \(x\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
