[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ### Step 3: Combine all the terms
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, add and combine all the values we computed:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
