[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. Reduce the fraction to its lowest terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ( to get $1 + \frac{3}{b}$ reduce $1$ to $1 + \frac{3+0+0+0}{b} = 1\frac{3+0+0+0}{b} = \frac{4}{b}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. Thus, $\frac{3}{b}$ becomes $\frac{4}{b}$ when reduced to its lowest terms.
