[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m      \left( \frac{10.74 + 0.7562}{2}, \frac{0 + 1.8836}{2} \right) = (5.7481, 0.9418)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    - **Altitude from \(A\) to \(BC\):**
