[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1\frac{1}{6} = 1 + \frac{1}{6} = \frac{6}{6} + \frac{1}{6} = \frac{7}{6}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So the expression becomes:
