[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First, recall the formula for the sum of the interior numbers in the n-th row of Pascal's Triangle:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ \sum_{i=0}^{n} \binom{n}{i} = 2^n \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
