[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Since we are dealing with the seventh row (n = 7), let's apply the formula again:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - The sum of the interior numbers in the seventh row will be \( 2^7 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let's calculate this using Python to ensure accuracy.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ```python
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m import math
