[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To simplify $(3-i)(6+2i)$, distribute each term in the first complex number to each term in the second complex number. We get:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$(3-i)(6+2i) = 3 \cdot 6 + 3 \cdot 2i - i \cdot 6 - i \cdot 2i$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Simplify each term:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$= 18 + 6i - 6i - 2i^2$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Recall that $i^2 = -1$. Substitute $-1$ for $i^2$:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$= 18 + 6i - 6i - 2(-1)$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Combine the real and imaginary parts:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$= 18 + 6i - 6i + 2$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The imaginary part cancels out completely, and the real part remains:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$= 18 + 2$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus, the simplified expression is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$18 + 2 = 20$$
