[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We will implement a function to compute the nth triangular number using this formula.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m ```python
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m def triangular_number(n):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m     return n * (n + 1) // 2
