[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Compute $\cos 150^\circ$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To compute \(\cos 150^\circ\), we will use trigonometric identities. The cosine function is related to the sine function via the identity \(\cos θ = \sin(90^\circ - θ)\).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Given:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \cos 150^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First, apply the identity:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \cos 150^\circ = \sin(90^\circ - 150^\circ)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, simplify the angle subtraction:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 90^\circ - 150^\circ = -60^\circ
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, use the identity \(\sin(-60^\circ) = -\sin(60^\circ)\).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Recall the value of \(\sin(60^\circ)\), which is \(\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\).
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Thus,
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \sin(-60^\circ) = -\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So, 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \cos 150^\circ = -\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \boxed{-\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m -\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m [Is Boxed Matched]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m True
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
