[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Determine the value of the infinite product $(2^{1/3})(4^{1/9})(8^{1/27})(16^{1/81}) \dotsm.$  Enter your answer in the form "\sqrt[a]{b}", which stands for $\sqrt[a]{b}.$
