[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 1. **Calculate the cost of one chocolate bar:**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    Jamie buys one chocolate bar and three vanilla bars.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \text{Cost of one chocolate bar} = c
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
