[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \sin 79^\circ \approx 0.9135
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. **Find the arccosine of the approximate value of $\sin 79^\circ$:**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    We know that $\arccos x = \frac{\pi}{2} - \arcsin x$ for $x$ in the range $-1 \leq x \leq 1$. Therefore:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
