[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. **Multiply both sides by \(\sqrt[4]{x}\):**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \sqrt[4]{x} \cdot \sqrt[4]{x} = \frac{12}{7 - \sqrt[4]{x}}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. **Simplify the left-hand side using the property \(\sqrt[4]{x} \cdot \sqrt[4]{x} = x\):**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    x = \frac{12}{7 - \sqrt[4]{x}}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 4. **Cross-multiply to eliminate the fraction:**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    x (7 - \sqrt[4]{x}) = 12
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 5. **Distribute \(x\) on the left-hand side:**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    7x - x \sqrt[4]{x} = 12
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 6. **Rearrange the equation to isolate terms involving \(\sqrt[4]{x}\):**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    -x \sqrt[4]{x} = 12 - 7x
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 7. **Factor out a common term \(-x\) on the left-hand side:**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    -x (\sqrt[4]{x} + 7) = 12
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 8. **Solve for \(\sqrt[4]{x} + 7\):**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \sqrt[4]{x} + 7 = -12
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 9. **Isolate \(\sqrt[4]{x}\) by subtracting 7 from both sides:**
