[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. \(b = -1\)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 3. From \(2a c = b \Rightarrow 2(-1)\left(\frac{1}{3}\right) = -\frac{2}{3} \Rightarrow c = -\frac{2}{3}\)
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Given this, we can find \(b\) directly:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[b = 2a + 1\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[b = -1 + 1\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[b = 0\]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So, the correct values are \(a = -1\), \(b = 0\), and \(c = -\frac{2}{3}\).
