[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Compute $\dbinom{11}{9}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To compute $\dbinom{11}{9}$, we can use the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\dbinom{n}{k} = \frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m In this case, $n = 11$ and $k = 9$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Plugging these values into the formula, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\dbinom{11}{9} = \frac{11!}{9!(11-9)!}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\dbinom{11}{9} = \frac{11!}{9!2!}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m We can simplify this calculation by canceling out common factors in the numerator and denominator.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First, we cancel out $9!$ (9 factorial) in the numerator and denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\dbinom{11}{9} = \frac{11 \cdot 10 \cdot 9!}{9! \cdot 2!}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, we cancel out $9!$ (9 factorial) in both the numerator and denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\dbinom{11}{9} = \frac{11 \cdot 10}{2!}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Then, we cancel out $2!$ (2 factorial) in the numerator:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\dbinom{11}{9} = \frac{11 \cdot 10}{2}\cdot 1$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Final step: We cancel out $1$ in the numerator:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\dbinom{11}{9} = 11 \cdot 5$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m And there we have it! We have successfully computed $\dbinom{11}{9}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $\dbinom{11}{9} = \boxed{55}$
