[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    Since \(X\) is the midpoint of segment \(ST\), and because \(PQRST\) is regular, the arc \(QX\) subtends an angle of \(72^\circ\) at \(PST\).
