[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[\mathbf{M} \begin{pmatrix} x \\ y \\ z \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} y \\ z \\ x + y + z \end{pmatrix}\]for all real numbers $x,$ $y,$ and $z.$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
