[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m A right rectangular prism has a base area one-quarter the base area of a larger right rectangular prism. The height of the smaller prism is half the height of the larger one. What is the ratio of the volume of the smaller prism to the volume of the larger prism? Express your answer as a common fraction.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve this problem, let's first understand the relationship between the volumes of the two prisms.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The volume of a prism is given by the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ V = \text{Base Area} \times \text{Height} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let \( B \) be the base area of the smaller prism and \( H \) be its height. Similarly, let \( B' \) be the base area of the larger prism and \( H' \) be its height. According to the problem:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ B' = \frac{1}{4}B \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ H' = \frac{1}{2}H \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The volume of the smaller prism \( V' \) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ V' = B' \times H' = \frac{1}{4}B \times \frac{1}{2}H = \frac{1}{8}B \times H \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m And the volume of the larger prism \( V \) is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ V = B \times H \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m The ratio of the volume of the smaller prism to the volume of the larger prism is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ \frac{V'}{V} = \frac{\frac{1}{8}B \times H}{B \times H} = \frac{\frac{1}{8}B \times H}{B \times H} = \frac{\frac{1}{8}}{1} = \frac{1}{8} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So the ratio is:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[ \boxed{\frac{1}{8}} \]<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \frac{1}{8}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m [Is Boxed Matched]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m True
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
