[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To evaluate \(\sqrt[3]{12} \times \sqrt[3]{20} \times \sqrt[3]{15} \times \sqrt[3]{60}\), we will use the property of cube roots that states \(\sqrt[3]{a} \times \sqrt[3]{b} \times \sqrt[3]{c} = \sqrt[3]{a \times b \times c}\). This allows us to simplify the expression.
