[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. **Find \(f(x)\) in terms of \(x\):**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    Substitute \(f(x)\) into \(g(x)\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    g(f(x)) = 2(ax + b) - 5
