[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve the problem, we need to find a common form for the square roots. 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First, we can simplify the square root of $81$:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\sqrt{81} = 9$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, we can rewrite the given expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$\sqrt[4]{81} \cdot \sqrt[3]{27} \cdot \sqrt{9}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Substituting the simplified value of $81$:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$9 \cdot \sqrt[3]{27} \cdot \sqrt{9}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Next, we simplify:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$ \sqrt[3]{27} = 3$$  [Note that the $3$ can be written as $3^{1/3}$]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$ \sqrt{9 } = 3 $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So now we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$9 \cdot 3 \cdot \sqrt{9}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$9 \cdot 3 \cdot 3$$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Let's calculate the value:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$ \sqrt{9} = 3 $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $$ 9 \cdot 3 \cdot 3 = 27 \cdot 3 = 81 $$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the final answer is: 81<|endoftext|>
