[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To find the length of $\overline{CB}$, we can use the properties of parallel lines and the proportional length ratios.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Given:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m - $\overline{DE} \parallel \overline{AB}$
