[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m      \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 2. **Calculate the square root of 8:**
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    - We know that \(\sqrt{8}\) is not an integer, but it is a square root of 8.
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m    - We need to determine the exact value of \(\sqrt{8}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m      \[
