[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m To solve for \(x\) and \(y\) and subsequently the product \(xy\), we start with the given equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \frac{8}{\sqrt{x}} = \frac{1}{2}
