[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m First, we eliminate the fraction by cross-multiplying:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 8 \cdot 2 = 1 \cdot \sqrt{x}
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 16 = \sqrt{x}
