[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m By multiplying both sides by 256, we find:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 256 \cdot 256 = x \implies x = 65536
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Now, given \(y = 4x \cdot y\), we substitute \(x = 65536\):
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m y = 4 \cdot 65536 \cdot y \implies y = 262144y
