[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $0 < \frac{(x - 17)2}{10x(x^2+1)}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $0 < \frac{2(x - 17)}{10x(x^2+1)}$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m $0 < \frac{(x - 17)}{5(x^2+1)}$
