[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m That means, of the following parts:
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m For $\text{I left,}$:\text{If $x < -1,$}\quad \ldots \ldots $
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Since we have successively $x < -1$, \ldots \ldots , the established inequalities are $\ldots \ldots$
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m So, \ldots \ldots
[36m(main_task pid=1983818)[0m Therefore, the answer is: $\boxed{(-\infty, -1)}$.
